ed scores nothing in it: you'll have to sell or earn money before teams lock.",". Si":". If",". Si acepta, pagas al momento y juega contigo el tiempo pactado; luego vuelve con él.":". If they accept, you pay right away and it plays with you for the agreed time; then it goes back to them.","· ¡sin un solo fallo!":"· without a single mistake!","· disponible para pujar":"· available to bid","· en el campo":"· on the field","· en el equipo":"· in the team","· en el mercado":"· on the market","· en venta":"· for sale","· eres admin":"· you're an admin","· intento":"· attempt","· la liga empezó de cero después":"· the league restarted from scratch afterwards","· libre":"· free","· máximo":"· max","· pista: tipo":"· hint: type","· prueba":"· round","· raro":"· rare","· Saldo:":"· Balance:","· si la jornada empezase ahora":"· if the matchday started now","· también":"· also","· temporada terminada":"· season over","(el más reciente, a la izquierda)":"(most recent on the left)","(en la demo todo pasa al abrir la app)":"(in the demo everything happens when you open the app)","(o incluye alguna en la oferta)":"(or include one in the offer)","(si la liga activa la multiposición)":"(if the league turns on multi-position)","(sin código)":"(no code)","(tú)":"(you)",") y la jornada":") and matchday","); la jornada se puntúa el día":"); the matchday is scored on day","): no sigue la temporada real.":"): it doesn't follow the real season.","). La clasificación vuelve a cero.":"). The standings go back to zero.","). Los admins pasan los días en Herramientas de Administración → Simulación.":"). Admins advance the days in Admin Tools → Simulation.","). Los premios de temporada se suman al dinero inicial; los trofeos y el palmarés se conservan.":"). Season prizes are added to the starting money; trophies and the honours list are kept.","% de lo invertido":"% of what's invested","% de lo invertido en cada jornada. Ahora pagas":"% of what's invested every matchday. You now pay","% del valor":"% of value","% del valor del equipo":"% of the team value","% y el":"% and","+ criaturas)":"+ creatures)","+2 (sólo cuenta el grupo de 3)":"+2 (only the group of 3 counts)","✦ Radiante: si puntúa en positivo, da el doble a su mánager":"✦ Radiant: if it scores positive, it gives its manager double","🔒 El mercado de fichajes está cerrado":"🔒 The transfer market is closed","₽ en caja por cada ₽ de plantilla: los valores varían un":"₽ in cash for every ₽ of squad value: values change by","1 entre":"1 in","1 jornada":"1 matchday","1 jornada a la semana":"1 matchday a week","1 jornada al día":"1 matchday a day","1.ª División de Paldea":"Paldea 1st Division","1.º de la jornada":"1st of the matchday","10 jornadas":"10 matchdays","2 días antes":"2 days before","2 jornadas":"2 matchdays","2 jornadas a la semana":"2 matchdays a week","2.ª División de Paldea":"Paldea 2nd Division","2.º de la jornada":"2nd of the matchday","3 días antes":"3 days before","3 jornadas":"3 matchdays","3 jornadas a la semana":"3 matchdays a week","3.º de la jornada":"3rd of the matchday","4.096 es la de los juegos actuales (8.192, la de los clásicos). Si queréis verlas más a menudo, recomendamos 1 entre 1.024 (con 20 criaturas nuevas al día, una radiante cada 7 semanas de media) o, para una liga corta, 1 entre 512 (una cada 3-4 semanas). Con":"4,096 is the rate in current games (8,192 in the classic ones). If you want to see them more often, we recommend 1 in 1,024 (with 20 new creatures a day, one radiant every 7 weeks on average) or, for a short league, 1 in 512 (one every 3-4 weeks). With","5 jornadas":"5 matchdays","8 criaturas (6 en el equipo y 2 en la caja) y 0 ₽":"8 creatures (6 in the team and 2 in the box) and 0 ₽","8 criaturas (6 en el equipo y 2 en la caja) y 25.000 ₽":"8 creatures (6 in the team and 2 in the box) and 25,000 ₽","a favor":"in favour","A las 21:00, si te queda alguna misión diaria.":"At 21:00, if you still have a daily mission left.","a precio fijo":"at a fixed price","Abajo":"Bottom","Abandonar":"Leave","Abierta":"Open","Abierto":"Open","Abierto hasta el":"Open until","Abono":"Bonus","Abono fijo por jornada":"Fixed bonus per matchday","Abono o penalización":"Bonus or penalty","abre el Mercado Negro (si el Team Rocket tiene algo que vender)":"opens the Black Market (if Team Rocket has something to sell)","Abre Herramientas de Administración para elegirlo todo (reglas opcionales, primas, mercado…) antes de crearla.":"Opens Admin Tools to choose everything (optional rules, bonuses, market…) before creating it.","Abre la app y entra en esta liga.":"Open the app and go into this league.","Abre todos los días: cobras en cada renovación del mercado.":"Open every day: you earn at each market refresh.","Abrir el mercado de fichajes":"Open the transfer market","Abrir el Mercado Negro ahora":"Open the Black Market now","Acaba de cambiar de dueño por cláusula: está protegido hasta el":"It just changed owner through a release clause: it's protected until","Acaba de cambiar de dueño por cláusula: está protegido unos días":"It just changed owner through a release clause: it's protected for a few days","Academia Naranja":"Orange Academy","Acento":"Accent","acepta, pasan a su equipo al momento.":"accepts, they go to their team right away.","aceptan esta oferta":"they accept this offer","Aceptar":"Accept","Acerca de":"About","Acero":"Steel","Activadas.":"On.","adivina el nombre de una especie.":"guess the name of a species.","admins: se decide por mayoría simple y el voto del fundador vale doble.":"admins: decided by simple majority and the founder's vote counts double.","Agua":"Water","Ahora mismo hay":"Right now there are","Ahora:":"Now:","Ajustes":"Settings","Ajustes guardados: aparecen en las novedades de la liga.":"Settings saved: they appear in the league news.","Al activarlas, el teléfono te pedirá permiso.":"When you turn them on, the phone will ask for permission.","Al crearla tendrás un código para invitar a tus amigos; también podrás nombrar más admins.":"Once created you'll have a code to invite your friends; you'll also be able to appoint more admins.","Al día":"Per day","al empezar la jornada":"when the matchday starts","al firmar":"on signing","Al inicio de la jornada (con el primer combate)":"At the start of the matchday (with the first battle)","Al inicio del día (con la apertura del mercado, a las":"At the start of the day (when the market opens, at","Al puntuar cada jornada, cada mánager paga un porcentaje de lo que ha invertido en su gimnasio y su guardería. Las mejoras tardan más en pagarse y dejan de ser dinero gratis para siempre.":"When each matchday is scored, every manager pays a percentage of what they've invested in their gym and nursery. Upgrades take longer to pay off and are no longer free money forever.","Al puntuar cada jornada, cada mánager paga un porcentaje del valor de todas sus criaturas (también las de la caja). Tener una plantilla cara cuesta dinero.":"When each matchday is scored, every manager pays a percentage of the value of all their creatures (including those in the box). An expensive squad costs money.","Al puntuarse cada jornada.":"When each matchday is scored.","Al ritmo de una liga de verdad: el mercado se renueva cada día.":"At the pace of a real league: the market refreshes every day.","Alegreya Sans SC (clásica)":"Alegreya Sans SC (classic)","Algunas criaturas dominan más de una posición: con la regla activa pueden alinearse en cualquiera de ellas; sus puntos no cambian.":"Some creatures master more than one position: with the rule on, they can be lined up in any of them; their points don't change.","Alineación guardada":"Lineup saved","Alineaciones":"Lineups","Alternativo":"Alternative","Alto Mando":"Elite Four","Amor Ball":"Love Ball","amplía":"expands","Ampliar":"Expand","Añadir bot":"Add bot","Añadir criaturas tuyas a la oferta":"Add your creatures to the offer","Aparecerá al crear la liga: pásaselo a tus amigos para que se unan.":"It will appear when the league is created: give it to your friends so they can join.","Apertura del Mercado Negro":"Black Market opening","Aplazado":"Postponed","Aplicar":"Apply","Aplicar a la liga":"Apply to the league","Aplicar penalización":"Apply penalty","Apodo":"Nickname","Apodo de manager":"Manager nickname","Apoyo":"Assist","Aprender es una aventura":"Learning is an adventure","Apuntando la misión…":"Recording the mission…","Aquí saldrán los fichajes, las ventas y los resultados de cada jornada.":"Signings, sales and the results of each matchday will appear here.","Aristócrata":"Aristocrat","Arriba":"Top","Artesanía de Ciudad Azalea":"Azalea Town Crafts","Artista":"Artist","Así te llegarán los avisos de tus ligas.":"This is how your league alerts will reach you.","Ataque":"Attack","Ataque fallado":"Missed attack","atlético":"athletic","Aún no se ha disputado: los 6 más probables de cada equipo.":"Not played yet: each team's 6 most likely.","Aún no se ha jugado ninguna jornada en esta temporada":"No matchday has been played this season yet","Aún no se ha jugado ninguna jornada.":"No matchday has been played yet.","Aún no tienes criaturas. En cuanto se repartan, aquí aparecerá tu equipo.":"You don't have creatures yet. As soon as they're handed out, your team will appear here.","Aún no tienes títulos: los dan algunos trofeos":"You don't have titles yet: some trophies give them","Avanzar día":"Advance day","Aviso a la liga":"Notice to the league","Aviso de":"Notice from","Aviso de Pokefantasy":"Pokefantasy notice","Aviso enviado: ya está en el feed de la liga.":"Notice sent: it's already in the league feed.","Avisos":"Alerts","Avisos en el teléfono de lo que pasa en tus ligas. Sólo en este dispositivo.":"Phone alerts about what happens in your leagues. Only on this device.","Azul acero, gris, negro y blanco, con el césped de siempre.":"Steel blue, grey, black and white, with the usual pitch.","Azul de Kalos y rojo intenso, con destellos de cristal.":"Kalos blue and deep red, with crystal sparkles.","Azules de mar abierto y espuma, con letra pixelada clásica.":"Open-sea blues and foam, with classic pixel lettering.","Baja":"Out","Bajar la puja":"Lower the bid","balompié":"football","Banco Meowth":"Meowth Bank","Bangers (cómic)":"Bangers (comic)","Barra de pestañas":"Tab bar","Bicho":"Bug","Bicis Rydel":"Rydel's Cycles","Blanco limpio y luminoso, con letra pixelada.":"Clean, bright white, with pixel lettering.","Borde del campo":"Pitch border","Borra todas las ligas de la demo de este móvil (tu apodo e imagen se quedan).":"Deletes all demo leagues on this phone (your nickname and picture stay).","Borrar":"Delete","BORRAR":"DELETE","Borrar datos de la demo":"Delete demo data","Borrar la liga":"Delete the league","Bot añadido: jugará solo.":"Bot added: it will play on its own.","Botones de menú y ajustes":"Menu and settings buttons","Botones secundarios":"Secondary buttons","Brasas y tonos volcánicos, con letra pixelada clásica.":"Embers and volcanic tones, with classic pixel lettering.","Buceo Ball":"Dive Ball","Buenos contactos: el Team Rocket te ofrece más por lo que vendes.":"Good contacts: Team Rocket offers you more for what you sell.","Burger Slaking":"Slaking Burger","Buscar":"Search","Buscar criatura":"Search creature","Caballero":"Gentleman","Caballero Diego":"Gentleman Diego","Cabecera":"Header","Cada criatura libre que sale en el mercado puede salir shiny. Una radiante da el doble de puntos cuando puntúa en positivo (con la Megapiedra, ×4); su valor no cambia y sigue shiny hasta que se reinicie la liga.":"Every free creature appearing in the market can come out shiny. A radiant one gives double points when it scores positive (with the Mega Stone, ×4); its value doesn't change and it stays shiny until the league is reset.","Cada criatura tiene una cláusula (1,5 veces su valor o la que fije su dueño; subirla cuesta el 5 % de lo que sube). Quien la pague se la lleva sin preguntar.":"Every creature has a release clause (1.5 times its value or the one its owner sets; raising it costs 5% of the increase). Whoever pays it takes the creature without asking.","Cada día puede aparecer un huevo. De él nace una cría: tus canteranos. No juegan en tu equipo, pero entrenan y juegan en categorías inferiores y te dan dinero cada jornada. También puedes traspasarlos.":"An egg may appear every day. A baby hatches from it: your youth players. They don't play in your team, but they train and play in lower categories and earn you money every matchday. You can also transfer them.","Cada día toca uno (el mismo para todos).":"A different one each day (the same for everyone).","Cada día, a la hora de la renovación.":"Every day, at refresh time.","cada hueco vacío del equipo resta 4 puntos":"each empty slot in the team takes away 4 points","Cada jornada se puntúa sola cuando terminan todos sus combates.":"Each matchday is scored automatically when all its battles end.","Cada jornada, cada mánager da la Megapiedra a un titular que pueda megaevolucionar: sus puntos cuentan el doble (también los negativos).":"Each matchday, every manager gives the Mega Stone to a starter that can Mega Evolve: its points count double (negative ones too).","Cada mánager conserva sus criaturas, su dinero, su gimnasio y su guardería.":"Every manager keeps their creatures, money, gym and nursery.","Cada mánager firma con una marca que le paga una prima, un fijo por jornada y un extra según su contrato.":"Every manager signs with a brand that pays a signing bonus, a fixed amount per matchday and an extra depending on the contract.","Cada mánager puede invertir en las instalaciones de su gimnasio para ganar dinero.":"Every manager can invest in their gym facilities to make money.","Cafetería":"Café","Caja":"Box","Cajas con bordes rectos.":"Boxes with square corners.","Cajas con bordes redondeados.":"Boxes with rounded corners.","Cajas con volumen y un campo con textura de pixel art (hierba, lava, mar, arena…) según el tema.":"Boxes with depth and a pitch with pixel-art texture (grass, lava, sea, sand…) depending on the theme.","Calabazas, murciélagos, telarañas, fantasmas y letra de miedo.":"Pumpkins, bats, cobwebs, ghosts and spooky lettering.","Calendario, resultados, puntos y lesiones simulados (las lesiones duran jornadas). Ideal para jugar contra bots o en solitario.":"Simulated calendar, results, points and injuries (injuries last matchdays). Ideal for playing against bots or solo.","Calendario, resultados, puntos, traspasos y lesiones de la temporada real.":"Calendar, results, points, transfers and injuries from the real season.","Calvo":"Bald Guy","Cambiado: se aplicará al crear la liga.":"Changed: it will be applied when the league is created.","Cambiar":"Change","Cambiar contraseña":"Change password","Cambiar correo":"Change email","Cambiar de paquete":"Change pack","Cambiar de posición":"Change position","Cambiar oferta":"Change offer","Cambiar propuesta":"Change proposal","Cambiar puja":"Change bid","Campeón":"Champion","Campeón de liga":"League champion","Campeón de Liga":"League Champion","Campista":"Camper","Campo (franja A)":"Pitch (stripe A)","Campo (franja B)":"Pitch (stripe B)","Campo de acero":"Steel field","Campo de antaño":"Old-times field","Campo de arena":"Sand field","Campo de distorsión":"Distortion field","Campo de fuego":"Fire field","Campo de hojas":"Leaf field","Campo de luz":"Light field","Campo de mareas":"Tide field","Campo de neón":"Neon field","Campo de paradoja":"Paradox field","Campo de prisma":"Prism field","Campo de sombras":"Shadow field","Cancelado":"Cancelled","Cancelar":"Cancel","Canjear":"Redeem","Canteranos":"Youth players","Canteranos a la vez":"Youth players at once","Cantidad en ₽":"Amount in ₽","Cantidad en pokéyenes":"Amount in pokéyen","Cargando criaturas…":"Loading creatures…","Cargando especies…":"Loading species…","Cargando liga…":"Loading league…","Cargando…":"Loading…","Casi todo se puede cambiar después en Herramientas de Administración.":"Almost everything can be changed later in Admin Tools.","Cazabichos":"Bug Catcher","Cazabichos Teo":"Bug Catcher Teo","Ceder":"Lend","Cedidos a otros":"Lent to others","Centro de Curación":"Healing Centre","Cerebrito":"Schoolkid","Cerrado":"Closed","Cerrar":"Close","Cerrar el mercado de fichajes":"Close the transfer market","Cerrar el Mercado Negro":"Close the Black Market","Cerrar la temporada":"Close the season","Cerrar sesión":"Log out","Cesiones":"Loans","Cesiones y préstamos":"Loans and lending","Chakra Petch (tecno)":"Chakra Petch (techno)","Chica":"Lass","Chica guay":"Cool Girl","Chica guay Bea":"Cool Girl Bea","Cielo azul y recuadros de 8 bits, con sprites, iconos y letra pixelada de antaño.":"Blue sky and 8-bit boxes, with old-time sprites, icons and pixel lettering.","Científico":"Scientist","Científico Sergio":"Scientist Sergio","Cierra los equipos: a partir de aquí nadie puede cambiar el suyo hasta puntuar.":"Locks the teams: from here nobody can change theirs until scoring.","Cierre de equipos":"Team lock","Cinco plantas de todo":"Five floors of everything","Cinzel (épica)":"Cinzel (epic)","Ciudad de noche: asfalto, neón y lima eléctrica.":"City at night: asphalt, neon and electric lime.","Clásico":"Classic","Clasificación":"Standings","Clasificación de la liga":"League standings","Cláusula":"Release clause","Clausulazos":"Release clauses","Cobertura en todas las regiones":"Coverage in every region","cobra la cláusula.":"collects the release clause.","Cobrada":"Collected","cobrados hoy":"collected today","Código":"Code","CÓDIGO":"CODE","Código copiado.":"Code copied.","Código de la liga:":"League code:","Código para invitar mánagers":"Code to invite managers","Coleccionista":"Collector","Color principal (botones)":"Main colour (buttons)","Colores pastel, huevos pintados, flores y banderines.":"Pastel colours, painted eggs, flowers and bunting.","Colores planos, como siempre.":"Flat colours, as always.","Combate":"Battle","Combates":"Battles","Combates simulados: la jornada termina y se puntúa sola el":"Simulated battles: the matchday ends and is scored automatically on","Combatientes":"Fighters","Como la liga paga sueldos, no recibes nada: te ahorras su sueldo.":"As the league pays wages, you get nothing: you save its wage.","Como una ventana de fichajes: hasta que lo abráis no se puede pujar, ofertar, vender ni comprar (tampoco al Team Rocket, en eventos, cláusulas ni cesiones). Se anulan las pujas y ofertas pendientes y se retira todo lo que estaba en venta. Se sigue alineando y cobrando.":"Like a transfer window: until you open it, nobody can bid, offer, sell or buy (not to Team Rocket, in events, clauses or loans either). Pending bids and offers are cancelled and everything for sale is withdrawn. Lineups and payments go on.","Comprar":"Buy","Con código":"With a code","Con el mantenimiento de esta liga, esta ampliación no llega a pagarse.":"With this league's upkeep, this expansion never pays off.","Con el mantenimiento de esta liga, esta mejora no llega a pagarse.":"With this league's upkeep, this upgrade never pays off.","Con los ajustes de siempre y, además: huecos vacíos penalizados, saldo negativo permitido, Mercado Negro con las criaturas propias del Team Rocket y multiposición.":"With the usual settings plus: empty slots penalised, negative balance allowed, Black Market with Team Rocket's own creatures and multi-position.","con pujas":"with bids","Con una plantilla de":"With a squad of","Confirmar":"Confirm","Confuso":"Confused","Congelado":"Frozen","Construcciones Tyranitar":"Tyranitar Construction","Construir":"Build","Contraseña":"Password","Contraseña actual":"Current password","Contraseña cambiada.":"Password changed.","Contraseña nueva":"New password","contusión en el hombro":"shoulder bruise","Copa Mundial":"World Cup","Copiado al portapapeles.":"Copied to the clipboard.","Copiar":"Copy","Copiar el texto":"Copy the text","Correo":"Email","Correo nuevo":"New email","Crea tu cuenta de manager":"Create your manager account","Creación rápida":"Quick setup","Creando la liga…":"Creating the league…","Crear cuenta":"Create account","Crear liga":"Create league","Crear liga con los ajustes seleccionados":"Create league with the selected settings","Crear una cuenta nueva":"Create a new account","Crear una liga":"Create a league","Créditos":"Credits","Creepster (terror)":"Creepster (horror)","Criador experto":"Expert Breeder","Criadora":"Breeder","Criatura de la temporada:":"Creature of the season:","Criatura vendida":"Creature sold","Criaturas":"Creatures","criaturas · valor":"creatures · value","Criaturas a la venta a la vez":"Creatures for sale at once","Criaturas con el mismo Entrenador Original.":"Creatures with the same Original Trainer.","criaturas de esta temporada.":"creatures this season.","Criaturas de Pokefantasy":"Pokefantasy creatures","criaturas del juego cambian de aspecto":"game creatures change their look","Criaturas del mismo equipo de Paldea.":"Creatures from the same Paldea team.","criaturas del Team Rocket hasta que empiece la jornada":"Team Rocket creatures until the matchday starts","Criaturas en la plantilla":"Creatures in the squad","Criaturas fichadas":"Creatures signed","Criaturas libres nuevas cada día":"New free creatures each day","criaturas nuevas al día en el mercado sale, de media,":"new creatures a day on the market, on average there's","Criaturas propias del Team Rocket":"Team Rocket's own creatures","Criaturas que te ofrecen":"Creatures they offer you","criaturas que valían":"creatures worth","Criaturas radiantes":"Radiant creatures","Criaturas vendidas":"Creatures sold","criaturas: vende alguna antes":"creatures: sell one first","Cristal":"Crystal","cuádriceps":"quadriceps","Cualquier manager puede pagarla y llevárselo sin preguntarte. Subirla cuesta el 5 % de lo que sube.":"Any manager can pay it and take it without asking you. Raising it costs 5% of the increase.","Cuando abre el Mercado Negro.":"When the Black Market opens.","Cuando ganas una puja o te aceptan una oferta.":"When you win a bid or an offer of yours is accepted.","cuando los admins pasen al día siguiente":"when admins move to the next day","cuando los admins renueven el mercado":"when admins refresh the market","Cuando nazca tu primer bebé aparecerá aquí.":"When your first baby hatches it will appear here.","Cuando terminen todos los combates":"When all battles are over","Cuando un mánager oferta por una de tus criaturas.":"When a manager makes an offer for one of your creatures.","Cuando un mánager te ofrece criaturas a cambio de una tuya.":"When a manager offers you creatures in exchange for one of yours.","Cuando un mánager te pide cedida una criatura.":"When a manager asks to borrow one of your creatures.","Cuando una criatura tuya pasa a otro mánager.":"When one of your creatures moves to another manager.","Cuenta":"Account","Cuenta y Acerca del juego":"Account and About the game","Cuidamos de ti":"We take care of you","Cumple tu primera misión.":"Complete your first mission.","Da 8 criaturas al azar (6 para el equipo y 2 para la caja) y los pokéyenes iniciales a quien aún no tenga.":"Gives 8 random creatures (6 for the team and 2 for the box) and the starting pokéyen to anyone who doesn't have them yet.","Dama":"Lady","Dama Rosa":"Lady Rosa","Damisela":"Madame","Dar abono":"Give bonus","Dar patrocinadores nuevos rompe el contrato actual (la prima ya cobrada no se devuelve).":"Giving new sponsors breaks the current contract (the bonus already collected isn't returned).","Datos de la temporada actualizados: equipos, posiciones y valores al día. Revisa tu alineación.":"Season data updated: teams, positions and values up to date. Check your lineup.","De":"From","de combate":"battle","de evento":"event","De managers":"From managers","De momento hay un solo sistema; más adelante podrá haber otros.":"For now there's only one system; there may be others later.","Debilitado":"Fainted","Debilitado por fiebre: está descansando en el centro de recuperación.":"Fainted with a fever: it's resting at the recovery centre.","Debilitado tras un combate muy duro: está en el centro de recuperación.":"Fainted after a very tough battle: it's at the recovery centre.","Debilitado tras un combate muy duro: no podrá combatir unos días.":"Fainted after a very tough battle: it won't be able to fight for a few days.","Degradado":"Gradient","Deja tu equipo al momento y vuelve a ser libre: puede salir otra vez en el mercado.":"It leaves your team right away and becomes free again: it may appear on the market again.","Del Team Rocket: nunca puntúa":"Team Rocket's: never scores","Del Team Rocket: tapa un hueco, pero nunca puntúa":"Team Rocket's: it fills a slot, but never scores","Desarrolladores":"Developers","Desbloqueado":"Unlocked","Descalificado":"Disqualified","Descargo de responsabilidad":"Disclaimer","Desconocida":"Unknown","Desde":"Since","Deuda máxima":"Maximum debt","Devon S.A.":"Devon Corp.","día":"day","Día":"Day","Diagonales":"Diagonals","Días pasando por tus ligas":"Days visiting your leagues","días.":"days.","Difícil":"Hard","Dinero de las jornadas":"Matchday money","Disposición de las barras":"Bar layout","dom 14:00":"Sun 14:00","dom 16:15":"Sun 16:15","dom 18:30":"Sun 18:30","dom 21:00":"Sun 21:00","Domador":"Tamer","Domadragón":"Dragon Tamer","Domadragón Raúl":"Dragon Tamer Raúl","Dominguera":"Picnicker","Dominguera Ana":"Picnicker Ana","Dormido":"Asleep","Dos mitades":"Two halves","Dragón":"Dragon","Duda":"Doubtful","Dueño":"Owner","Duerme tranquilo":"Sleep soundly","Duración":"Duration","Ej.: 3 de un equipo, 2 de otro y 1 suelta →":"E.g.: 3 from one team, 2 from another and 1 on its own →","Ej.: con":"E.g.: with","Ej.: este domingo cerramos la temporada; revisad vuestras alineaciones.":"E.g.: this Sunday we close the season; check your lineups.","el admin":"the admin","El admin":"The admin","El archivo está vacío.":"The file is empty.","el arranque de un ala":"the base of a wing","El cacao de los campeones":"The cocoa of champions","El calendario de la liga es ficticio y no depende de la hora: cada jornada ocupa una semana (empieza el viernes y se puntúa el domingo) y el Mercado Negro, si está activo, abre la víspera.":"The league calendar is fictional and doesn't depend on the time: each matchday takes a week (it starts on Friday and is scored on Sunday) and the Black Market, if active, opens the day before.","El comprador no tiene sitio en la caja":"The buyer has no room in their box","El comprador ya no tiene saldo suficiente":"The buyer no longer has enough money","El correo o la contraseña no son correctos.":"The email or password is incorrect.","El Corte Galar":"Galar Cut","el costado":"the side","el cuello":"the neck","El de siempre: césped de noche y letra sencilla.":"The usual: night pitch and simple lettering.","El del tema base":"The base theme's one","El frío más dulce":"The sweetest cold","el hueso de una pata":"the bone of a leg","El inicio de liga y el máximo de criaturas sólo se pueden cambiar antes de la primera jornada":"The league start and creature limit can only be changed before the first matchday","el lomo":"the back","El máximo de mánagers tiene que estar entre 2 y 30":"The maximum number of managers must be between 2 and 30","El mercado de fichajes está cerrado: los admins lo abrirán más adelante":"The transfer market is closed: the admins will open it later","El mercado de fichajes está cerrado.":"The transfer market is closed.","El Mercado Negro abre":"The Black Market opens","El Mercado Negro del Team Rocket ha cerrado.":"Team Rocket's Black Market has closed.","El Mercado Negro está abierto":"The Black Market is open","El Mercado Negro vende también criaturas del Team Rocket (Arbok de Jessie, Weezing de James…) al precio mínimo. Nunca puntúan: sólo sirven para no dejar huecos vacíos.":"The Black Market also sells Team Rocket's creatures (Jessie's Arbok, James's Weezing…) at the minimum price. They never score: they're only there so slots aren't left empty.","El mercado se abre en cuanto se repartan las criaturas. Después se renueva solo (":"The market opens as soon as creatures are handed out. Then it refreshes on its own (","El mercado ya está abierto":"The market is already open","El mercado ya está cerrado":"The market is already closed","el mismo día de la jornada":"on the matchday itself","El mismo día de la jornada":"On the matchday itself","El modo de juego (real o simulación) se elige al crear la liga y ya no se puede cambiar":"The game mode (real or simulation) is chosen when creating the league and can't be changed anymore","El modo online aún no está activado en esta versión.":"Online mode isn't enabled in this version yet.","el muslo de una pata":"the thigh of a leg","El rey de la siesta":"The king of naps","El Team Rocket abre el Mercado Negro, pero esta vez no tiene nada que vender.":"Team Rocket opens the Black Market, but this time it has nothing to sell.","El Team Rocket no tiene ninguna criatura: primero alguien tiene que venderle una.":"Team Rocket has no creatures: someone has to sell it one first.","El Team Rocket saca a la venta parte de las criaturas que le habéis vendido. Se cierra al empezar la jornada.":"Team Rocket puts up for sale some of the creatures you've sold it. It closes when the matchday starts.","El Team Rocket ya lo ha vendido todo.":"Team Rocket has already sold everything.","El tema Nostalgia está en desarrollo: no todas las criaturas tienen todavía sprite o icono de estilo Game Boy Color, y los que faltan se ven con el sprite normal.":"The Nostalgia theme is in development: not every creature has a Game Boy Color-style sprite or icon yet, and the missing ones show with the normal sprite.","el tendón de una pata":"the tendon of a leg","el tobillo de una pata":"the ankle of a leg","El valor empieza a moverse con la primera renovación del mercado.":"The value starts moving with the first market refresh.","Eléctrico":"Electric","Elegir paquete (.json)":"Choose pack (.json)","Elegirás el tipo de liga y si la quieres con los ajustes de siempre o a tu gusto.":"You'll choose the league type and whether you want the usual settings or your own.","Elige cuántas jornadas":"Choose how many matchdays","Elige patrocinador":"Choose a sponsor","Elige un mánager":"Choose a manager","Elige una liga, crea una nueva para jugar con tus amigos o únete con el código que te hayan pasado.":"Pick a league, create a new one to play with your friends or join with the code they've given you.","Empate":"Draw","Empezar":"Start","Empezar de cero":"Start from scratch","Empezar jornada":"Start matchday","Empezar nueva temporada":"Start new season","empieza el día":"starts on day","Empieza en la jornada 1 y se simula todo: calendario, resultados, puntos y lesiones. Ideal contra bots o en solitario.":"It starts on matchday 1 and everything is simulated: calendar, results, points and injuries. Ideal against bots or solo.","Empieza sola el":"It starts on its own on","en caja paga":"in cash pays","En casa":"Home","en contra":"against","En desarrollo":"In development","En el campo, el Muro y los 5 que más puntuaron; en reservas, los demás que combatieron. Con borde dorado, los tuyos.":"On the pitch, the Wall and the top 5 scorers; in reserves, the others who fought. Gold border: yours.","En el modo demo no hay contraseña.":"There's no password in demo mode.","En el modo demo no hay correo ni contraseña: todo se guarda en este móvil, contra bots.":"In demo mode there's no email or password: everything is saved on this phone, against bots.","En el modo demo no hay correo.":"There's no email in demo mode.","En el modo demo no hay más managers: crea tu propia liga.":"There are no other managers in demo mode: create your own league.","En el navegador sólo llegan mientras la página está abierta.":"In the browser they only arrive while the page is open.","En esta liga las misiones no dan pokéyenes: son sólo por el honor.":"In this league missions don't give pokéyen: they're just for honour.","En esta liga los admins han desactivado las guarderías.":"In this league the admins have turned off nurseries.","En esta liga los admins han desactivado los gimnasios.":"In this league the admins have turned off gyms.","En esta liga no hay cesiones":"There are no loans in this league","En esta liga no hay cláusulas":"There are no release clauses in this league","En esta liga no hay gimnasios":"There are no gyms in this league","En esta liga no hay guarderías":"There are no nurseries in this league","En este mercado se puja: el que más ofrezca se la lleva al renovarse":"This market works with bids: the highest offer takes it at refresh","En forma: listo para combatir":"In form: ready to battle","en juego":"in play","En juego":"In play","En la caja":"In the box","en la caja. Puedes fichar en el Mercado o cambiar de formación.":"in the box. You can sign on the Market or change formation.","en la cantera ·":"in the youth academy ·","En la demo juegas contra bots en este móvil.":"In the demo you play against bots on this phone.","En la demo se juega en este móvil contra bots (elige cuántos en Mánagers).":"In the demo you play on this phone against bots (choose how many in Managers).","En la demo se juega en este móvil contra bots: para unirte a la liga de tus amigos hace falta jugar online.":"In the demo you play on this phone against bots: to join your friends' league you need to play online.","en los últimos":"in the last","en lugar de":"instead of","en otro sitio":"somewhere else","en su sitio":"in place","en venta":"for sale","En venta":"For sale","Encuentra las 6 parejas con las criaturas de tu equipo. No hay prisa ni se puede perder.":"Find the 6 pairs with your team's creatures. There's no rush and you can't lose.","encuentra las parejas con las criaturas de tu equipo.":"find the pairs with your team's creatures.","Energía para todo Galar":"Energy for all of Galar","Energía que aleja a los salvajes":"Energy that keeps wild ones away","Ensueño Ball":"Dream Ball","Entra en tu cuenta":"Sign in to your account","Entrar":"Sign in","Entre":"Between","Entre el":"Between","Entre el 75 % y el 90 % (tacaño)":"Between 75% and 90% (stingy)","Entre el 85 % y el 100 %":"Between 85% and 100%","Entre el 90 % y el 110 % del valor (recomendado)":"Between 90% and 110% of the value (recommended)","Entre el 95 % y el 120 % (generoso)":"Between 95% and 120% (generous)","Entrenador":"Trainer","Entrenador guay":"Ace Trainer","Entrenador Original":"Original Trainer","Entrenadora guay":"Ace Trainer","Entrenadora guay Lía":"Ace Trainer Lía","Envenenado":"Poisoned","Enviando…":"Sending…","Enviar":"Send","ENVIAR":"SEND","Enviar aviso":"Send notice","Enviar una notificación de prueba":"Send a test notification","Equipa la Megapiedra por primera vez.":"Equip the Mega Stone for the first time.","Equipar la Megapiedra":"Equip the Mega Stone","Equipo":"Team","Equipo completo y 25.000 ₽":"Full team and 25,000 ₽","Equipo completo, sin dinero":"Full team, no money","Equipo ideal":"Ideal team","Equipos de la nueva temporada":"New season's teams","Equipos, criaturas, patrocinadores y futbolistas":"Teams, creatures, sponsors and footballers","Eres el fundador de esta liga: no puedes abandonarla mientras haya más managers.":"You're the founder of this league: you can't leave it while there are other managers.","Es de":"It belongs to","Esa criatura está cedida":"That creature is on loan","Esa criatura no es tuya":"That creature isn't yours","Esa criatura ya está cedida":"That creature is already on loan","Esa criatura ya no es tuya":"That creature is no longer yours","Esa criatura ya no está en el mercado especial":"That creature is no longer on the special market","Esa criatura ya no está en el Mercado Negro":"That creature is no longer on the Black Market","Esa criatura ya no está en venta: para pedírsela, ofrece alguna de tus criaturas a cambio":"That creature is no longer for sale: to ask for it, offer one of your creatures in exchange","Esa criatura ya no está libre en el mercado":"That creature is no longer free on the market","Esa criatura ya tiene dueño":"That creature already has an owner","Esa liga no existe":"That league doesn't exist","Esa oferta ya no existe":"That offer no longer exists","Esa propuesta ya no existe":"That proposal no longer exists","Escribe el aviso":"Write the notice","Escribe el motivo: lo verá toda la liga":"Write the reason: the whole league will see it","Escribe un apodo":"Write a nickname","Escribe un nombre para la liga":"Write a name for the league","Escribe una cantidad":"Write an amount","Ese canterano ya no está en tu guardería":"That youngster is no longer in your nursery","Ese código no es de ningún tema.":"That code doesn't belong to any theme.","Ese manager no es un bot":"That manager isn't a bot","Ese manager no está en la liga":"That manager isn't in the league","Ese manager ya no está en la liga":"That manager is no longer in the league","Ese patrocinador no te ha hecho ninguna oferta":"That sponsor hasn't made you any offer","esguince de tobillo":"sprained ankle","Especies de la misma región (Kanto, Johto…).":"Species from the same region (Kanto, Johto…).","Está cedida: no se puede liberar":"It's on loan: it can't be released","Está cedido: no lo puedes vender":"It's on loan: you can't sell it","Está cedido: su cláusula no se puede pagar":"It's on loan: its clause can't be paid","Esta cesión no tiene opción de compra":"This loan has no purchase option","esta criatura":"this creature","Está en el centro de recuperación.":"It's at the recovery centre.","Está libre.":"It's free.","Esta liga está en simulación: calendario, combates, puntos y lesiones se simulan; no sigue la temporada real.":"This league is a simulation: calendar, battles, points and injuries are simulated; it doesn't follow the real season.","Esta liga sigue la temporada real: no se puede simular. Para probar a tu ritmo, crea una liga en modo simulación.":"This league follows the real season: it can't be simulated. To try it at your own pace, create a league in simulation mode.","Esta liga sigue la temporada real: su calendario, sus combates y sus puntos son los de verdad y no se puede simular. Para jugar a tu ritmo, crea una liga nueva en modo simulación (Ajustes → Ligas → Crear una liga).":"This league follows the real season: its calendar, battles and points are the real ones and it can't be simulated. To play at your own pace, create a new league in simulation mode (Settings → Leagues → Create a league).","Esta temporada se cerró antes de que hubiera resúmenes: sólo queda la clasificación.":"This season ended before there were summaries: only the standings remain.","Esta versión no puede usar paquetes de criaturas.":"This version can't use creature packs.","Esta vez no ha podido ser.":"It wasn't to be this time.","Estadio de noche: acero, cian y fucsia, con letra de marcador.":"Night stadium: steel, cyan and fuchsia, with scoreboard lettering.","Estadísticas":"Statistics","estas criaturas":"these creatures","Estás en negativo (":"You're in the red (","Este navegador no admite notificaciones.":"This browser doesn't support notifications.","Estilo de las cajas":"Box style","Estratega":"Strategist","Evento":"Event","Eventos":"Events","Exclusiva de los mercados de evento: de colección, nunca puntúa":"Exclusive to event markets: collectible, never scores","Exclusiva del evento: de colección, nunca puntúa":"Event exclusive: collectible, never scores","Exo 2 (futurista)":"Exo 2 (futuristic)","Exorcista":"Exorcist","Expulsar":"Kick out","Fabricantes de la Poké Ball":"Poké Ball makers","Fácil":"Easy","Fantasma":"Ghost","Ficha criaturas de los equipos de Paldea, monta tu equipo de seis con una buena estrategia y suma puntos cada jornada según lo que rindan.":"Sign creatures from Paldea's teams, build your team of six with a good strategy and score points every matchday based on how they perform.","Ficha una criatura en el Mercado Negro del Team Rocket.":"Sign a creature on Team Rocket's Black Market.","Ficha una criatura en un mercado de evento.":"Sign a creature in an event market.","Ficha una criatura: en el mercado, a otro mánager, en un evento o al Team Rocket.":"Sign a creature: on the market, from another manager, at an event or from Team Rocket.","Fichajes":"Signings","Fichajes en el Mercado Negro":"Black Market signings","Fichajes en mercados de evento":"Event market signings","Fichajes, ventas y resultados":"Signings, sales and results","Fichar en el Mercado Negro":"Sign on the Black Market","Fichar en un mercado de evento":"Sign in an event market","Fichar una criatura":"Sign a creature","Fichas de todas las criaturas de la temporada":"Cards for every creature of the season","Fin de temporada":"End of season","Finales":"Finals","Firmando…":"Signing…","Firmar":"Sign","Focos de luz":"Spotlights","Fondo":"Background","Formación":"Formation","fractura en el pie":"broken foot","Fredoka (redondeada)":"Fredoka (rounded)","Fuego":"Fire","Fuera":"Away","Fundación Æther":"Aether Foundation","Fundador":"Founder","Gana tu primera liga: termina una temporada en lo más alto.":"Win your first league: finish a season at the top.","Ganador de jornada":"Matchday winner","ganas esta puja":"you win this bid","Gastos de la jornada:":"Matchday expenses:","Gastos fijos al puntuar cada jornada:":"Fixed expenses when each matchday is scored:","Gestiona los ajustes de tu liga":"Manage your league settings","Gestiona los ajustes de tu liga.":"Manage your league settings.","Gestionar ajustes":"Manage settings","Gimnasio (taquilla y tienda)":"Gym (ticket office and shop)","Gimnasio en marcha":"Gym running","Gimnasio legendario":"Legendary gym","Gimnasios":"Gyms","Gimnasios reiniciados.":"Gyms reset.","golpe en la cabeza":"blow to the head","golpe en la rodilla":"blow to the knee","Gradas":"Stands","Gran Almacén Azulona":"Celadon Department Store","Gris acero y oro, con un aire de otra dimensión.":"Steel grey and gold, with an otherworldly air.","Guarda el palmarés con el resumen de cada mánager y da los premios de temporada (":"Saves the record with each manager's summary and hands out the season prizes (","Guarda el palmarés y el resumen de cada mánager y reparte los premios de temporada. La clasificación vuelve a cero, terminan las cesiones y llegan ofertas de patrocinio nuevas. Se conservan los equipos o se empieza de cero, según elijas.":"Saves the record and each manager's summary and hands out the season prizes. The standings reset to zero, loans end and new sponsorship offers arrive. Teams are kept or you start from scratch, as you choose.","Guardabosques":"Ranger","Guardar":"Save","Guardar alineación":"Save lineup","Guardar nombre":"Save name","Guardar premios":"Save prizes","Guardar primas":"Save bonuses","Guardería":"Nursery","Guardería (canteranos)":"Nursery (youth academy)","Guardería de lujo":"Luxury nursery","Guardería en marcha":"Nursery running","Guarderías (cantera)":"Nurseries (youth academy)","Guarderías reiniciadas.":"Nurseries reset.","Guarida Rocket":"Rocket Hideout","Ha terminado la temporada":"The season has ended","Hace lo mismo que la renovación diaria de las 7:00: resuelve las pujas, actualiza los valores, saca criaturas nuevas y el Team Rocket hace sus ofertas.":"Does the same as the daily 7:00 refresh: resolves bids, updates values, brings out new creatures and Team Rocket makes its offers.","Hace unos segundos":"A few seconds ago","Hacer admin":"Make admin","Hacer una oferta":"Make an offer","Hada":"Fairy","Has vendido una criatura":"You've sold a creature","Hasta":"Until","hasta que empiece la jornada":"until the matchday starts","Hasta que empiece la jornada":"Until the matchday starts","hasta que empieza la jornada":"until the matchday starts","Hay":"There are","Hay criaturas desconocidas en el equipo":"There are unknown creatures in the team","Hay criaturas en el equipo que ya no son tuyas":"There are creatures in the team that are no longer yours","Hay mucho movimiento en la liga ahora mismo: vuelve a intentarlo en unos segundos":"There's a lot going on in the league right now: try again in a few seconds","Haz tu primera puja u oferta.":"Make your first bid or offer.","Haz una puja":"Place a bid","Hecho: aparece en las novedades de la liga.":"Done: it appears in the league news.","Hecho.":"Done.","Herramientas de Administración":"Administration Tools","Hielo":"Ice","Hola,":"Hi,","Honor Ball":"Premier Ball","Hora de apertura":"Opening time","Hora de renovación":"Refresh time","Hoy":"Today","Huecos y segmentos":"Gaps and segments","Huevo":"Egg","Huevos":"Eggs","Huevos y canteranos que dan dinero":"Eggs and youngsters that earn money","Imagen cambiada.":"Image changed.","Imagen de manager":"Manager image","Importar un paquete":"Import a pack","Impuesto de fin de temporada":"End-of-season tax","Inflación":"Inflation","Información":"Information","Inicio":"Home","Inicio de liga":"League start","Instalación de élite":"Elite facility","Instalación desconocida":"Unknown facility","Instalaciones del gimnasio al máximo":"Gym facilities maxed out","Intentos":"Attempts","Intercambio":"Trade","Intercambios":"Trades","Invertido":"Invested","Jornada":"Matchday","Jornada anterior":"Previous matchday","Jornada puntuada":"Matchday scored","Jornada siguiente":"Next matchday","Jornadas con la Megapiedra":"Matchdays with the Mega Stone","Jornadas ganadas":"Matchdays won","Jornadas jugadas":"Matchdays played","Joven":"Youngster","Joven Joaquín":"Youngster Joaquín","Juega como siempre: puja con cabeza, alinea a los mejores e invierte cuando le sobra.":"Plays as usual: bids wisely, fields the best and invests when it has money to spare.","Juega el minijuego diario":"Play the daily minigame","Juega tu primer minijuego diario.":"Play your first daily minigame.","Juego de gestión hecho por fans: formas un equipo de seis criaturas, fichas en el mercado y compites con tus amigos jornada a jornada. Es gratuito y sin ánimo de lucro: no tiene anuncios, compras ni ningún otro tipo de ingreso, y se comparte sólo de forma privada.":"A fan-made management game: you build a team of six creatures, sign on the market and compete with your friends matchday by matchday. It's free and non-profit: it has no ads, purchases or any other kind of income, and it's only shared privately.","Jugar":"Play","Jugar el minijuego diario":"Play the daily minigame","Jugar online con amigos":"Play online with friends","Jugar online con amigos (con cuenta)":"Play online with friends (with an account)","Jugón":"Gamer","Karateka":"Black Belt","Karateka Koji":"Black Belt Koji","KO a un compañero":"KO a teammate","la cabeza":"the head","la cadera":"the hip","La cantidad no puede ser negativa":"The amount can't be negative","La cantidad y el motivo serán públicos para toda la liga.":"The amount and the reason will be public to the whole league.","La contraseña necesita al menos 6 caracteres.":"The password needs at least 6 characters.","La formación del juego que más puntos habría sumado en esta jornada.":"The game formation that would have scored the most points on this matchday.","La jornada aún no ha empezado: hasta que el admin la empiece puedes cambiar tu equipo.":"The matchday hasn't started yet: until the admin starts it you can change your team.","La jornada empieza sola con su primer combate: hasta entonces puedes cambiar tu equipo.":"The matchday starts on its own with its first battle: until then you can change your team.","La jornada va a empezar":"The matchday is about to start","La liga está completa":"The league is full","La liga usa las criaturas de siempre.":"The league uses the usual creatures.","La liga vuelve a empezar: nuevo reparto de criaturas y dinero.":"The league starts over: new handout of creatures and money.","La liga vuelve a empezar.":"The league starts over.","La más rica de Johto":"The richest in Johto","La Megapiedra tiene que llevarla una criatura del campo":"The Mega Stone has to be held by a creature on the pitch","la página no trae lesionados (¿ha cambiado su formato?)":"the page has no injured players (has its format changed?)","la pantorrilla de una pata":"the calf of a leg","la próxima jornada":"the next matchday","la próxima vez).":"next time).","la rodilla de una pata":"the knee of a leg","la simulación pasa a ser manual: los admins avanzan el mercado y las jornadas":"the simulation becomes manual: admins advance the market and the matchdays","La tecnología de Hoenn":"Hoenn's technology","la víspera de la jornada":"the eve of the matchday","La víspera de la jornada":"The eve of the matchday","La votación para borrar la liga no sale adelante.":"The vote to delete the league doesn't pass.","Laboratorios Lysson":"Lysandre Labs","Ladrón":"Burglar","Las criaturas originales y todos los nombres, personajes, imágenes y marcas relacionados son propiedad de sus titulares: Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. y The Pokémon Company. Pokefantasy es un proyecto no oficial: no está afiliado, patrocinado, respaldado ni aprobado por ninguna de esas empresas, y no pretende infringir sus derechos. Los nombres de equipos y patrocinadores son inventados o parodias.":"The original creatures and all related names, characters, images and trademarks are the property of their owners: Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. and The Pokémon Company. Pokefantasy is an unofficial project: it is not affiliated with, sponsored, endorsed or approved by any of those companies, and it is not intended to infringe their rights. Team and sponsor names are made up or parodies.","Las criaturas que no se hayan vendido se quedan con el Team Rocket.":"Creatures that haven't been sold stay with Team Rocket.","Las criaturas vendidas al Team Rocket pueden volver a la venta antes de cada jornada, a precio fijo. Sus opciones están en Mercado.":"Creatures sold to Team Rocket can go back on sale before each matchday, at a fixed price. Its options are in Market.","Las misiones dan dinero":"Missions give money","las misiones dan pokéyenes":"missions give pokéyen","Las misiones de hoy y tu vitrina":"Today's missions and your trophy case","Las misiones diarias siguen yendo a tiempo real.":"Daily missions still run in real time.","las misiones ya no dan pokéyenes: son sólo por el honor":"missions no longer give pokéyen: they're just for honour","Las ofertas a otros mánagers pueden llevar hasta 3 criaturas tuyas, además del dinero o en su lugar. Con criaturas de por medio se puede proponer un intercambio por cualquier criatura de otro mánager, aunque no la tenga en venta.":"Offers to other managers can include up to 3 of your creatures, in addition to the money or instead of it. With creatures involved you can propose a trade for any creature of another manager, even if it isn't for sale.","Las opciones del Team Rocket aparecen al activar el Mercado Negro en Reglas opcionales.":"Team Rocket's options appear when you turn on the Black Market in Optional rules.","Las que no están en el equipo de 6. Con estos valores, cada mánager puede tener hasta":"The ones not in the team of 6. With these values, each manager can have up to","Las siguientes llegan":"The next ones arrive","las sinergias cuentan sólo el grupo más grande de cada tipo":"synergies only count the biggest group of each type","las sinergias cuentan todos los grupos":"synergies count every group","Le propones a":"You propose to","Leche Mu-mu":"Moomoo Milk","Leyendo…":"Reading…","Libre":"Free","Libres":"Free","Líder de Gimnasio":"Gym Leader","Liga":"League","Liga a tiempo real":"Real-time league","Liga borrada.":"League deleted.","Liga creada.":"League created.","Liga del Gimnasio Plateada":"Pewter Gym League","Liga simulada":"Simulated league","Liga simulada (":"Simulated league (","Ligas":"Leagues","Ligas ganadas":"Leagues won","Línea":"Line","Liso":"Plain","Llega antes que nadie":"Get there before anyone","Llega la temporada real: cada criatura tiene ya su equipo, su posición y su valor de verdad. Revisa tu alineación.":"The real season is here: every creature now has its real team, position and value. Check your lineup.","Lleva tu guardería al nivel máximo.":"Take your nursery to the top level.","Lleva una instalación del gimnasio al nivel máximo.":"Take a gym facility to the top level.","Lo que gana depende de lo que vendas al Team Rocket.":"What it earns depends on what you sell to Team Rocket.","Lo que ofrece por las criaturas que pongáis en venta.":"What it offers for the creatures you put up for sale.","Lo que pongas en venta aparece en el mercado para los demás managers. Si nadie oferta, el Team Rocket te hará una oferta en la próxima renovación.":"Whatever you put up for sale appears on the market for the other managers. If nobody makes an offer, Team Rocket will make you one at the next refresh.","Lo tiene el Team Rocket.":"Team Rocket has it.","Lo tienes cedido":"You have it on loan","Lo ven todos los jugadores de todas las ligas, al momento.":"Every player in every league sees it, instantly.","Los 20 equipos de Primera: cada criatura combate con su equipo de Paldea.":"The 20 top-flight teams: each creature battles with its Paldea team.","Los 22 equipos de Segunda, con criaturas que no juegan en Primera (o de otro Entrenador Original).":"The 22 second-division teams, with creatures that don't play in the top flight (or from another Original Trainer).","Los admins cierran el mercado de fichajes: hasta que vuelva a abrir no se puede pujar, ofertar, vender ni comprar.":"The admins close the transfer market: until it reopens you can't bid, make offers, sell or buy.","Los admins de la liga lo abrirán más adelante. Mientras tanto no se puede pujar, ofertar, vender ni comprar, pero sí alinear, cobrar y mejorar tu gimnasio y tu guardería.":"The league admins will open it later. Meanwhile you can't bid, make offers, sell or buy, but you can set your lineup, collect and upgrade your gym and nursery.","Los admins reinician las guarderías: sin huevos ni canteranos.":"The admins reset the nurseries: no eggs or youngsters.","Los admins reinician los gimnasios: todas las instalaciones vuelven a nivel 0.":"The admins reset the gyms: every facility goes back to level 0.","Los bots pujan, venden, alinean y gestionan su gimnasio solos. Se pueden añadir o quitar después.":"Bots bid, sell, set lineups and run their gym on their own. They can be added or removed later.","Los bots pujan, venden, hacen y responden ofertas, alinean su equipo y gestionan su gimnasio solos, cada vez que se renueva el mercado. Si se quita un bot, sus criaturas quedan libres.":"Bots bid, sell, make and answer offers, set their lineup and run their gym on their own, every time the market refreshes. If a bot is removed, its creatures become free.","Los combates aplazados o adelantados son de esta jornada pero se juegan en otra fecha: sus criaturas suman los puntos cuando se juegan, y la jornada de la liga empieza y termina con el resto.":"Postponed or brought-forward battles belong to this matchday but are played on another date: their creatures add the points when they're played, and the league matchday starts and ends with the rest.","Los equipos de los demás se ven cuando empieza la jornada.":"Other managers' teams are shown when the matchday starts.","Los equipos empezarán de cero. Pulsa otra vez para confirmar.":"Teams will start from scratch. Tap again to confirm.","los equipos se cierran con el primer combate de cada jornada":"teams lock with the first battle of each matchday","los equipos se cierran con la apertura del mercado el día del primer combate de cada jornada":"teams lock when the market opens on the day of each matchday's first battle","los huecos vacíos ya no restan puntos":"empty slots no longer take points away","Los intercambios de criaturas están desactivados en esta liga":"Creature trades are turned off in this league","los músculos de la pata trasera":"the muscles of the hind leg","Los patrocinadores están desactivados en esta liga":"Sponsors are turned off in this league","Los puntos de los combates se simulan.":"Battle points are simulated.","Los títulos se consiguen con algunos trofeos (Misiones y trofeos).":"Titles are earned with some trophies (Missions and trophies).","Los trofeos son de tu cuenta: se ganan una sola vez, jugando en cualquiera de tus ligas, y no dan dinero. Algunos desbloquean temas de pantalla y títulos.":"Trophies belong to your account: they're won only once, playing in any of your leagues, and they don't give money. Some unlock screen themes and titles.","Luces de colores, acebo, nieve que cae y gorro de Papá Noel.":"Coloured lights, holly, falling snow and a Santa hat.","Lucha":"Fighting","Luchadora":"Battle Girl","Lujo Ball":"Luxury Ball","lun 21:00":"Mon 21:00","Luna Ball":"Moon Ball","Luz verde para tu equipo":"Green light for your team","Malabarista":"Juggler","Mánager":"Manager","mánagers":"managers","Mánagers":"Managers","managers · código":"managers · code","managers, código":"managers, code","Mantener los equipos":"Keep the teams","Mantenimiento":"Upkeep","Mantenimiento de esta liga: el":"Upkeep of this league: the","Mantenimiento de las instalaciones":"Facility upkeep","Manual (día a día)":"Manual (day by day)","Mañana (":"Tomorrow (","Mañana, otra ronda.":"Tomorrow, another round.","Mañana, otra.":"Tomorrow, another one.","Maratones de cine digital":"Digital film marathons","Marcador en KOs. 💥 KO · 🤝 Apoyo · 🛡\ufe0f Protección · 🔥⚡☠\ufe0f💤❄\ufe0f💫 problema de estado · 🟥 Descalificado":"Score in KOs. 💥 KO · 🤝 Support · 🛡\ufe0f Protection · 🔥⚡☠\ufe0f💤❄\ufe0f💫 status condition · 🟥 Disqualified","Marinero":"Sailor","Más público en tus combates: cobras taquilla en cada jornada.":"Bigger crowds at your battles: you collect ticket money every matchday.","Máximo de criaturas por mánager":"Maximum creatures per manager","Máximo de mánagers":"Maximum managers","Mecánico":"Mechanic","Media":"Average","Mediados":"Mid","Médium":"Channeler","Médium Carmen":"Channeler Carmen","Megaevolución":"Mega Evolution","Megapiedra":"Mega Stone","Megapiedra (capitán ×2)":"Mega Stone (captain ×2)","Mejor jornada":"Best matchday","Mejora las instalaciones para ganar dinero":"Upgrade the facilities to earn money","Mejorar":"Upgrade","Mentalista":"Psychic","Menú":"Menu","Menú a la derecha":"Menu on the right","Menú a la izquierda":"Menu on the left","Menú, saldo y ajustes":"Menu, balance and settings","Mercado":"Market","Mercado abierto: ya hay criaturas libres.":"Market open: there are free creatures now.","Mercado cerrado.":"Market closed.","Mercado de fichajes":"Transfer market","Mercado Negro":"Black Market","Mercado Negro del Team Rocket":"Team Rocket's Black Market","Mercado renovado":"Market refreshed","Meter":"Put in","Mi gimnasio":"My gym","Mi guardería":"My nursery","Mi liga":"My league","mi oferta":"my offer","mi puja":"my bid","miércoles":"Wednesday","Minijuego":"Minigame","Minijuegos diarios jugados":"Daily minigames played","Mínimo":"Minimum","Mis pujas y ofertas":"My bids and offers","Mis ventas":"My sales","Misiones cumplidas":"Missions completed","Misiones de evento":"Event missions","Misiones de hoy":"Today's missions","Misiones pendientes":"Pending missions","Misiones y trofeos":"Missions and trophies","Mochilera":"Backpacker","Mochilera Sara":"Backpacker Sara","Moda salvaje":"Wild fashion","Modelo":"Model","Moderno":"Modern","Modo de juego":"Game mode","Modo demo: no hace falta correo, se guarda en este móvil.":"Demo mode: no email needed, it's saved on this phone.","molestias en el aductor":"adductor discomfort","Montañero":"Hiker","Montañero Rufo":"Hiker Rufo","Motivo (p. ej. «Ganador de la porra»)":"Reason (e.g. \"Prediction pool winner\")","Motorista":"Biker","Mountains of Christmas (festiva)":"Mountains of Christmas (festive)","Mover aquí":"Move here","movimientos ·":"moves ·","Multiposición":"Multi-position","Muro":"Wall","Muy en forma: dos combates seguidos brillando":"In great form: two battles in a row shining","Nada se tira, todo se aprovecha":"Nothing wasted, everything reused","Nada va solo ni depende de la hora: los admins pasan al día siguiente con «Avanzar día» (Herramientas de Administración → Simulación). Cada día se renueva el mercado; cada jornada empieza el viernes de su semana y se puntúa el domingo, y el Mercado Negro abre la víspera.":"Nothing runs on its own or depends on the time: admins move to the next day with \"Advance day\" (Administration Tools → Simulation). Each day the market refreshes; each matchday starts on the Friday of its week and is scored on Sunday, and the Black Market opens the day before.","Nadador":"Swimmer","Nadadora":"Swimmer","Nadadora Elisa":"Swimmer Elisa","Nadie empieza con criaturas y todos tienen 150.000 ₽ para fichar":"Nobody starts with creatures and everyone has 150,000 ₽ to sign","Navega por la carretera":"Ride the open road","Navidad":"Christmas","Negativo":"Negative","Negro profundo con destellos eléctricos azules.":"Deep black with blue electric sparks.","Negro, rojo y una gran R: para quien hace tratos con el Team Rocket.":"Black, red and a big R: for those who do deals with Team Rocket.","Nido Ball":"Nest Ball","Nieve":"Snow","Ningún huevo por ahora. Con más nivel aparecen más a menudo.":"No eggs for now. At higher levels they appear more often.","Ninguna criatura cumple esos filtros.":"No creature matches those filters.","Ninguna criatura del mercado cumple esos filtros.":"No market creature matches those filters.","Ninguno":"None","Ninguno.":"None.","Nivel Ball":"Level Ball","Nivel de la guardería":"Nursery level","Nivel de una instalación del gimnasio":"Level of a gym facility","Nivel máximo":"Max level","No es el nombre de ninguna especie.":"That's not the name of any species.","No es un archivo JSON válido.":"It's not a valid JSON file.","no está":"isn't there","No está en venta: añade al menos una criatura tuya":"It's not for sale: add at least one of your creatures","No estás en esta liga":"You're not in this league","No has pujado ni ofertado por ninguna criatura.":"You haven't bid or made an offer for any creature.","No hay conexión. Comprueba internet y vuelve a probar.":"No connection. Check your internet and try again.","No hay criaturas suficientes para esta rejilla.":"There aren't enough creatures for this grid.","No hay especies suficientes con sprite.":"There aren't enough species with a sprite.","No hay ninguna jornada en juego.":"There's no matchday in play.","No hay ninguna liga con ese código":"There's no league with that code","No puedes ofertar por esta criatura":"You can't make an offer for this creature","No puedes pagar la cláusula de esta criatura":"You can't pay this creature's clause","No se encuentra public/datos/pokedex.json. Ejecuta npm run datos:pokedex.":"public/datos/pokedex.json not found. Run npm run datos:pokedex.","No se ha guardado el archivo.":"The file hasn't been saved.","No se ha podido aplicar.":"It couldn't be applied.","No se ha podido copiar: prueba a guardarlo como archivo.":"Couldn't copy: try saving it as a file.","No se ha podido entrar.":"Couldn't sign in.","No se ha podido guardar: vuelve a intentarlo con conexión.":"Couldn't save: try again with a connection.","No se ha podido leer el archivo":"Couldn't read the file","No se puede expulsar al fundador de la liga":"The league founder can't be kicked out","No se puede usar":"Can't be used","no tenía equipo en esta jornada.":"had no team on this matchday.","No tienes equipo para esta jornada.":"You have no team for this matchday.","No tienes esta criatura cedida":"You don't have this creature on loan","No tienes más criaturas de":"You have no more creatures from","No trae ninguna criatura.":"It has no creatures.","Noche de Halloween":"Halloween Night","Noche violeta, sol naranja y un campo de arena de playa.":"Violet night, orange sun and a beach-sand pitch.","Noches Gengar":"Gengar Nights","Nombre":"Name","Nombre cambiado.":"Name changed.","Nombre de la liga":"League name","Nombre de manager":"Manager name","Nombre o número de especie":"Species name or number","Nombres de las criaturas":"Creature names","Notificaciones":"Notifications","Novedades":"News","Nueva cláusula":"New clause","Nueva liga":"New league","Nuevos patrocinadores":"New sponsors","Nuevos patrocinadores para todos":"New sponsors for everyone","º con":"º with","º de":"º of","Obras que no se derrumban":"Buildings that don't fall down","Obras…":"Works…","Ocaso Ball":"Dusk Ball","Ocio nocturno de Kanto":"Kanto nightlife","Oculto":"Hidden","Oferta":"Offer","Ofertado":"Offered","Ofertar":"Make an offer","Ofertas":"Offers","Ofertas de otros mánagers":"Offers from other managers","Ofertas del Team Rocket":"Team Rocket offers","Ofertas recibidas":"Offers received","Oficina de traspasos":"Transfer office","Opción de compra":"Purchase option","Orbitron (espacial)":"Orbitron (space)","Ordenar":"Sort","Origen":"Origin","Ornitólogo":"Bird Keeper","Ornitólogo Pablo":"Bird Keeper Pablo","Oro":"Gold","Oro (dinero, destacados)":"Gold (money, highlights)","Oswald (marcador)":"Oswald (scoreboard)","Otra partida":"Play again","Otro mánager ha cambiado la liga a la vez":"Another manager changed the league at the same time","Pagar la cláusula":"Pay the clause","Pagas por la cesión":"You pay for the loan","Palmarés":"Record","Paneles":"Panels","Paquete de criaturas":"Creature pack","Paquete sin nombre":"Unnamed pack","Para añadir mánagers, pásales el código de la liga:":"To add managers, give them the league code:","Para ligas de varias temporadas: al cerrar la temporada, cada mánager paga un porcentaje del dinero que tenga por encima de un mínimo (antes de cobrar los premios). No se cobra si los equipos empiezan de cero.":"For multi-season leagues: when the season closes, each manager pays a percentage of the money they have above a minimum (before collecting prizes). It isn't charged if teams start from scratch.","Para ligas de varias temporadas: los valores de mercado suben cuando en la liga hay mucho más dinero que valor en las plantillas (hasta un 3 % por jornada) y bajan un poco cuando el dinero escasea. Así el dinero acumulado no hace que todo salga regalado.":"For multi-season leagues: market values go up when there's much more money in the league than squad value (up to 3% per matchday) and go down a little when money is scarce. That way accumulated money doesn't make everything a giveaway.","Para llegar a todo con el pulgar, o a tu gusto. Sólo cambia en este dispositivo.":"To reach everything with your thumb, or as you like. Only changes on this device.","Paralizado":"Paralysed","Parejas":"Pairs","Participantes":"Participants","pasa a ser tuyo al momento y":"becomes yours right away and","Pasa al día siguiente del calendario de la liga: se renueva el mercado y, si toca, empieza o termina la jornada.":"Moves to the next day of the league calendar: the market refreshes and, if it's time, the matchday starts or ends.","Pasa por la liga":"Drop by the league","Pasa por una liga.":"Drop by a league.","Pasando los días…":"Passing the days…","Pasar por la liga":"Drop by the league","Pascua":"Easter","Patrocinado por":"Sponsored by","Patrocinador":"Sponsor","Patrocinadores":"Sponsors","Patrocinio, gimnasio y cantera":"Sponsorship, gym and youth academy","Pedir cedida una criatura de otro mánager por unas jornadas o toda la temporada, con o sin opción de compra.":"Ask another manager to loan you a creature for a few matchdays or the whole season, with or without a purchase option.","Pedir cedido":"Ask for a loan","Pelipper Envíos":"Pelipper Deliveries","Peluches y camisetas: cuanto mejor juega tu equipo, más vendes.":"Plushies and shirts: the better your team plays, the more you sell.","Penalización":"Penalty","Penalizar los huecos vacíos":"Penalise empty slots","Pergamino, tinta y praderas de otra época.":"Parchment, ink and meadows from another age.","Permitir saldo negativo":"Allow negative balance","Pescador":"Fisherman","Pescador Ramón":"Fisherman Ramón","Peso Ball":"Heavy Ball","Pestañas (Inicio, Liga, Equipo…)":"Tabs (Home, League, Team…)","Pídeselo al admin de la liga: lo tiene en Herramientas de Administración → Liga.":"Ask the league admin: they have it in Administration Tools → League.","Pivote":"Pivot","Pixelada (Diamante y Perla)":"Pixel (Diamond and Pearl)","Pixelada (Game Boy)":"Pixel (Game Boy)","Pixelada (Rojo Fuego)":"Pixel (FireRed)","Planta":"Grass","Plantilla exportada desde la app: cambia lo que quieras de cada criatura y vuelve a importarlo.":"Squad exported from the app: change whatever you want for each creature and import it again.","Plata":"Silver","Playera":"Beachgoer","Playero":"Beachgoer","plazas ·":"slots ·","Podrás quedártelo pagando el precio pactado mientras lo tengas cedido":"You can keep it by paying the agreed price while you have it on loan","Poké Balls Kurt":"Kurt's Poké Balls","Pokefantasy (sistema propio)":"Pokefantasy (own system)","Pokémaníaco":"PokéManiac","Pokémaníaco Lalo":"PokéManiac Lalo","Pokéyenes ahorrados":"Pokéyen saved","Poner a los que más puntúan":"Field the top scorers","Poner en venta":"Put up for sale","Poner una criatura a la venta":"Put a creature up for sale","Ponle un nombre a la liga.":"Give the league a name.","Por asignar":"To be assigned","Por cada punto conseguido":"For each point scored","Por cada titular en el equipo ideal":"For each starter in the ideal team","Por conseguir":"To earn","Por el bien de las criaturas":"For the good of creatures","por equipo. Cada tipo de sinergia se suma aparte.":"per team. Each type of synergy adds up separately.","por jornada":"per matchday","Por jornada":"Per matchday","por jornada (gimnasio y guardería).":"per matchday (gym and nursery).","por jornada por la inflación.":"per matchday due to inflation.","por jornada.":"per matchday.","Por un evento":"For an event","Por un trofeo":"For a trophy","Porcentaje":"Percentage","Portador de la Megapiedra":"Mega Stone holder","Posición":"Position","Positivo":"Positive","Práctica de desarrollador: una especie distinta cada partida; no cuenta para las misiones.":"Developer practice: a different species each game; it doesn't count for missions.","Práctica de desarrollador: una ronda distinta cada partida; no cuenta para las misiones.":"Developer practice: a different round each game; it doesn't count for missions.","Precio de compra":"Purchase price","Precio fijo: el primero que paga se lo lleva.":"Fixed price: the first to pay takes it.","Precio fijo: el primero que paga se lo lleva. Cierra":"Fixed price: the first to pay takes it. Closes","Premio de temporada":"Season prize","Premio:":"Prize:","Premios al cerrar la temporada (Liga → Fin de temporada).":"Prizes when the season closes (League → End of season).","Premios cambiados: se aplicarán al crear la liga.":"Prizes changed: they'll apply when the league is created.","Premios de temporada guardados.":"Season prizes saved.","Preparando…":"Getting ready…","Primas":"Bonuses","Primas cambiadas: se aplicarán al crear la liga.":"Bonuses changed: they'll apply when the league is created.","Primas de la liga":"League bonuses","Primas guardadas.":"Bonuses saved.","Primer canterano":"First youngster","Primer fichaje":"First signing","Primera puja":"First bid","Primera venta":"First sale","Principal oscuro":"Dark main","Principios":"Early","Privado":"Private","Probabilidad":"Probability","Probar la demo en este móvil":"Try the demo on this phone","Probar sin cuenta (demo en este móvil, contra bots)":"Try without an account (demo on this phone, against bots)","Problema de estado":"Status condition","Proponer cesión":"Propose loan","Proponer intercambio":"Propose trade","Proponer un intercambio":"Propose a trade","Propuesta de intercambio":"Trade proposal","Propuestas de intercambio":"Trade proposals","Protección":"Protection","Próxima":"Next","Próximo combate":"Next battle","Psíquica":"Psychic","Psíquica Nerea":"Psychic Nerea","Psíquico":"Psychic","Público":"Public","Puede que combata.":"It may battle.","Puedes adelantar cualquier paso con estos botones; lo demás sigue su curso solo.":"You can bring any step forward with these buttons; the rest carries on by itself.","Puja máxima":"Top bid","Puja poco y sin apurar, no usa la Megapiedra, apenas invierte y vende barato al Team Rocket.":"Bids little and without stretching, doesn't use the Mega Stone, barely invests and sells cheap to Team Rocket.","Puja por una criatura del mercado o de un evento, o haz una oferta a otro mánager.":"Bid on a creature from the market or an event, or make an offer to another manager.","Pujado":"Bid","Pujar":"Bid","Pujar u ofertar":"Bid or make an offer","Pujas u ofertas hechas":"Bids or offers made","pujas y ofertas":"bids and offers","Pulsa otra vez en 3 segundos para quitar el paquete: vuelven las criaturas de siempre.":"Tap again within 3 seconds to remove the pack: the usual creatures come back.","Pulsa otra vez en los próximos 3 segundos para confirmar.":"Tap again within the next 3 seconds to confirm.","Pulsa otra vez para liberarla":"Tap again to release it","Puntos":"Points","puntos ·":"points ·","Puntos en una jornada":"Points in a matchday","puntos para su equipo":"points for their team","puntos: mira tu resumen":"points: check your summary","Puntúan":"They score","Puntuar jornada":"Score matchday","Qué grupos cuentan":"Which groups count","Que nazca la primera cría de tu guardería.":"Have the first baby in your nursery hatch.","que te ceda a":"to loan you","Quedármelo por":"Keep it for","Quedaste":"You finished","Quemado":"Burned","Quien lo escriba en «Unirme con un código» entra en la liga y recibe su reparto.":"Whoever enters it in \"Join with a code\" joins the league and gets their handout.","Quitar":"Remove","Quitar admin":"Remove admin","Quitar bot":"Remove bot","Quitar del mercado":"Remove from market","Quitar el paquete":"Remove the pack","Rapid Ball":"Quick Ball","Rayas del campo":"Pitch stripes","Real: sigue la temporada de verdad":"Real: follows the actual season","Rechazar":"Decline","Reciclajes Muk":"Muk Recycling","Recién hechas en Pueblo Lavacalda":"Freshly made in Lavaridge Town","Red Ball":"Net Ball","Refresca hasta el último minuto":"Refreshes until the last minute","Región":"Region","Región de origen":"Home region","Reglas opcionales":"Optional rules","Reiniciar también gimnasios y guarderías":"Also reset gyms and nurseries","Reiniciar todas las guarderías":"Reset all nurseries","Reiniciar todos los gimnasios":"Reset all gyms","Reintentar":"Retry","Rejilla":"Grid","Renovar el mercado ahora":"Refresh the market now","Repartir criaturas":"Hand out creatures","Reservas":"Reserves","Resetear la liga":"Reset the league","Resumen":"Summary","Retirar":"Withdraw","Retirar la propuesta":"Withdraw the proposal","Rivales automáticos (bots)":"Automatic rivals (bots)","Roca":"Rock","Rockero":"Guitarist","Rockero Iván":"Guitarist Iván","Ronda terminada":"Round over","rotura del ligamento cruzado":"torn cruciate ligament","rotura fibrilar en el cuádriceps":"quadriceps muscle tear","Ruinamaníaco":"Ruin Maniac","sáb 14:00":"Sat 14:00","sáb 16:15":"Sat 16:15","sáb 18:30":"Sat 18:30","sáb 21:00":"Sat 21:00","sábado":"Saturday","Saldo":"Balance","Saldo actual":"Current balance","Saldo futuro":"Future balance","Sale destacado en el feed de todos los mánagers de esta liga.":"It's highlighted in the feed of every manager in this league.","Salen huevos, nacen crías y los canteranos dan dinero cada jornada.":"Eggs appear, babies hatch and youngsters earn money every matchday.","Se anularán las pujas y ofertas pendientes. Pulsa otra vez para cerrar el mercado.":"Pending bids and offers will be cancelled. Tap again to close the market.","Se aplica a quien aún no ha recibido su reparto.":"It applies to anyone who hasn't received their handout yet.","Se borra para todos los mánagers y no se puede deshacer.":"It's deleted for every manager and can't be undone.","Se cobran solas en cuanto las cumples.":"They pay out automatically as soon as you complete them.","Sé el mánager con más puntos de una jornada.":"Be the manager with the most points in a matchday.","Se pagan solas al puntuar cada jornada. Pon 0 para quitar una prima.":"They pay out automatically when each matchday is scored. Set 0 to remove a bonus.","Se puede cambiar después.":"It can be changed later.","se puede fichar quedando en negativo":"you can sign and go into the red","Se puede pujar y fichar quedando en negativo, hasta el porcentaje del valor del equipo que elijas. Aviso: quien empiece una jornada en negativo no puntúa en ella.":"You can bid and sign going into the red, up to the percentage of team value you choose. Warning: whoever starts a matchday in the red doesn't score in it.","se renueva el mercado":"the market refreshes","Se ve en todas tus ligas":"It shows in all your leagues","Secciones":"Sections","Segundo":"Second","Seguros Snorlax":"Snorlax Insurance","Selecciones de todas las regiones.":"Teams from every region.","Sencillo":"Simple","Señorita Aroma":"Aroma Lady","Si":"If","sí":"yes","Sí":"Yes","Si empiezas la próxima jornada así, no puntuarás en ella: vende o espera a las primas antes del cierre de equipos.":"If you start the next matchday like this, you won't score in it: sell or wait for the bonuses before teams lock.","Si eres titular de algún derecho y quieres que se retire cualquier contenido, escríbenos y lo quitaremos de inmediato.":"If you hold any rights and want any content removed, write to us and we'll take it down immediately.","Si la pagas,":"If you pay it,","Si no queda satisfecho, le devolvemos las Poké Balls":"If you're not satisfied, we'll give you your Poké Balls back","Si no, cada mánager conserva sus instalaciones.":"Otherwise, each manager keeps their facilities.","Sí, abandonar":"Yes, leave","Siempre a la vuelta de la esquina":"Always just around the corner","Siente el aura":"Feel the aura","Sigue la temporada de verdad: calendario, resultados, puntos, traspasos y lesiones reales.":"Follows the actual season: real calendar, results, points, transfers and injuries.","Siguiente":"Next","Silph S.A.":"Silph Co.","Siluetas":"Silhouettes","siluetas acertadas.":"silhouettes guessed.","Simulación":"Simulation","Simulación día a día: hoy es el día":"Day-by-day simulation: today is day","Simulación: empieza en la jornada 1":"Simulation: starts on matchday 1","Sin bajas":"No absences","sin campeón":"no champion","Sin combate.":"No battle.","Sin construir":"Not built","Sin contar fichajes, ventas, cafetería, misiones ni inversiones. Al cerrar la temporada tenía":"Not counting signings, sales, café, missions or investments. When the season closed they had","Sin criaturas y mucho dinero":"No creatures and lots of money","Sin equipo":"No team","Sin forma de desbloquearlo":"No way to unlock it","Sin imagen: se ve tu inicial":"No image: your initial is shown","Sin IndexedDB":"No IndexedDB","Sin límite":"No limit","sin límite de criaturas":"no creature limit","sin partidos":"no matches","Sin permiso del teléfono no se pueden enviar notificaciones. Puedes darlo en los ajustes de Android → Aplicaciones → Pokefantasy → Notificaciones.":"Without the phone's permission notifications can't be sent. You can grant it in Android settings → Apps → Pokefantasy → Notifications.","sin pujas":"no bids","Sin título":"No title","Sinergias":"Synergies","Siniestro":"Dark","sistema de puntuación cambiado":"scoring system changed","Sobre lo que pase de":"On whatever exceeds","sobrecarga en el gemelo":"calf strain","Socio del Team Rocket":"Team Rocket Partner","Sólo cambia en este dispositivo.":"Only changes on this device.","Sólo el dueño puede subir la cláusula":"Only the owner can raise the clause","Sólo el más grande de cada tipo (recomendado)":"Only the biggest of each type (recommended)","Sólo las ligas simuladas en modo manual avanzan día a día":"Only simulated leagues in manual mode advance day by day","Sólo lo ven los desarrolladores (para probarlo).":"Only developers see it (to test it).","Sólo los admins de la liga pueden hacer esto":"Only league admins can do this","Sólo los admins de la liga pueden poner un paquete de criaturas":"Only league admins can set a creature pack","Sólo los admins de la liga pueden quitar el paquete de criaturas":"Only league admins can remove the creature pack","Sólo los admins de la liga pueden usar este panel.":"Only league admins can use this panel.","Sólo para quien lo desbloquee: con un trofeo, entrando durante un evento o con un código.":"Only for whoever unlocks it: with a trophy, by playing during an event or with a code.","Sólo puedes pedir cedida una criatura de otro manager":"You can only ask to borrow a creature from another manager","Sólo se puede cambiar antes de la primera jornada.":"It can only be changed before the first matchday.","Sólo una criatura por jornada. Sus puntos cuentan el doble, también si son negativos.":"Only one creature per matchday. Its points count double, negative ones too.","Sólo votan los admins":"Only admins vote","Soporte":"Support","Sprites e iconos de Essentials BES y de sus colaboradores, tal como figuran en sus créditos. Fuentes pixeladas «DP» y «Rojo Fuego/Verde Hoja» de la comunidad y «Press Start 2P» (CodeMan38, licencia OFL). Sprites e iconos de estilo Game Boy Color del remake de Johto de la comunidad BES. Gracias a todos los que comparten sus recursos con los fans.":"Sprites and icons by Essentials BES and its contributors, as listed in its credits. Community pixel fonts \"DP\" and \"FireRed/LeafGreen\", and \"Press Start 2P\" (CodeMan38, OFL licence). Game Boy Color-style sprites and icons from the BES community's Johto remake. Thanks to everyone who shares their resources with fans.","su dueño":"its owner","Subiendo…":"Uploading…","Subir la puja":"Raise the bid","Subir por":"Raise by","Sueldos de las criaturas":"Creature salaries","Suma los puntos que ha hecho cada criatura de los equipos cerrados.":"Adds up the points each creature in the locked teams has scored.","Super Ball":"Great Ball","Tamaño máximo de la Caja":"Maximum Box size","También puede jugar de":"It can also play as","Tarjetas":"Cards","Tarjetas (2.º tono)":"Cards (2nd shade)","Te da embestidas":"gives you Take Down","Te han hecho una oferta":"You've received an offer","Te hemos enviado un correo a la dirección nueva: confírmalo para terminar el cambio.":"We've sent an email to the new address: confirm it to finish the change.","te lo pide cedido:":"asks to borrow it:","Te piden cedido":"Loan request","Te piden una criatura cedida":"You've been asked to loan a creature","Te proponen un intercambio":"You've been offered a trade","Te quedan misiones de hoy":"You have missions left today","te quedarás en":"you'll be left with","Teclado":"Keyboard","Técnico":"Technician","Teletranspórtate al podio":"Teleport to the podium","Tema de pantalla":"Screen theme","Temas":"Themes","Temporada":"Season","Temporada de prueba: puntos simulados.":"Test season: simulated points.","Temporadas terminadas":"Seasons finished","Tercero":"Third","Termina tu primera temporada.":"Finish your first season.","Terminada":"Finished","Teselia":"Unova","Texto":"Text","Texto suave":"Soft text","Texturas":"Textures","Tienda de recuerdos":"Souvenir shop","Tienes cambios sin guardar.":"You have unsaved changes.","Tienes que pujar al menos su valor":"You have to bid at least its value","Tierra":"Ground","Tipo":"Type","Tipo de liga":"League type","Tipo de puntuación":"Scoring type","tirón en el isquiotibial":"hamstring strain","Titulares que comparten equipo, Entrenador Original o región de origen: +1 punto por cada criatura a partir de la 2.ª (2 iguales → +1, 3 → +2…).":"Starters who share a team, Original Trainer or home region: +1 point for each creature from the 2nd on (2 alike → +1, 3 → +2…).","Título":"Title","Títulos, botones y cifras":"Titles, buttons and figures","Toca para cambiarla":"Tap to change it","Toca una criatura con mega para darle la Megapiedra de esta jornada (puntúa ×2).":"Tap a creature with a mega to give it this matchday's Mega Stone (scores ×2).","Toca una criatura del campo para cambiarla.":"Tap a creature on the pitch to swap it.","Toca una para elegirla":"Tap one to choose it","Tocado":"Hurt","toda la temporada":"the whole season","Toda la temporada":"The whole season","Todas las criaturas quedan libres y se reparte otra vez con el inicio de la liga (":"All creatures become free and are handed out again with the league start (","Todas tus criaturas están en el campo.":"All your creatures are on the pitch.","Todavía no está en ningún mercado de evento":"It's not in any event market yet","Todavía no estás en ninguna liga.":"You're not in any league yet.","Todavía no se ha jugado ninguna jornada.":"No matchday has been played yet.","Todos":"All","Todos los grupos":"All groups","Todos los mánagers empiezan así.":"Every manager starts like this.","Todos los managers reciben 3 ofertas de patrocinio nuevas.":"Every manager gets 3 new sponsorship offers.","Todos los mánagers tienen 3 ofertas de patrocinio nuevas.":"Every manager has 3 new sponsorship offers.","Total de la oferta:":"Total offer:","Traspasar":"Transfer","Tratos con el Team Rocket":"Deals with Team Rocket","Tres marcas quieren patrocinar a tu equipo":"Three brands want to sponsor your team","Tres marcas quieren patrocinar a tu equipo esta temporada. Elige bien: el contrato dura toda la temporada y su logo saldrá en tu campo.":"Three brands want to sponsor your team this season. Choose well: the contract lasts the whole season and their logo will appear on your pitch.","Tres veces más barato":"Three times cheaper","Trofeos":"Trophies","Trofeos de la temporada":"Season trophies","Tu contraseña":"Your password","Tu contrato de esta temporada":"Your contract this season","Tu enciclopedia de criaturas con datos ilimitados":"Your creature encyclopedia with unlimited data","Tu gimnasio":"Your gym","Tu imagen de manager":"Your manager image","Tu liga empieza a puntuar en la jornada":"Your league starts scoring on matchday","Tu patrocinador esta temporada:":"Your sponsor this season:","Tu pedido, por el aire":"Your order, by air","Tu saldo":"Your balance","Tú serás el fundador y admin de la liga.":"You'll be the founder and admin of the league.","Tu título (sale junto a tu apodo en todas tus ligas)":"Your title (shown next to your nickname in all your leagues)","Tus criaturas":"Your creatures","Tus criaturas, como nuevas":"Your creatures, good as new","Tuyo":"Yours","último día":"last day","Último día":"Last day","Últimos combates":"Latest battles","Últimos combates, del más reciente al más antiguo":"Latest battles, from most recent to oldest","Un admin":"An admin","Un archivo .json en el formato de paquetes de Pokefantasy (los desarrolladores tienen un exportador que hace de plantilla). Comprueba la lista antes de aplicarlo.":"A .json file in Pokefantasy's pack format (developers have an exporter that works as a template). Check the list before applying it.","Un combate sin incidencias.":"A battle without incident.","un golpe fuerte":"a heavy blow","Un mánager":"A manager","Un momento…":"One moment…","Un mundo más bello":"A more beautiful world","Un paquete viste la liga con criaturas de la franquicia que queráis, hecho por la comunidad. Cada criatura del paquete ocupa el sitio de una del juego: cambia su nombre, su imagen, sus tipos y su Entrenador Original, pero conserva su equipo, su posición, su precio y su forma de combatir, así que los puntos y el dinero siguen igual. Lo ven todos los mánagers de la liga.":"A pack dresses the league with whatever franchise creatures you like, made by the community. Each creature in the pack takes the place of one in the game: its name, image, types and Original Trainer change, but it keeps its team, position, price and way of battling, so points and money stay the same. Every manager in the league sees it.","un tirón":"a strain","una criatura":"a creature","Una criatura":"A creature","una de sus extremidades":"one of its limbs","una dolencia":"an ailment","Una entre":"One in","una fractura":"a fracture","una garra de las patas":"a claw on its feet","Una hora antes del cierre de equipos.":"One hour before teams lock.","una inflamación":"an inflammation","Una instalación del gimnasio al nivel máximo.":"A gym facility at the top level.","una lesión":"an injury","una operación que pide reposo largo":"an operation that needs long rest","una pata":"a leg","una rotura de ligamentos":"a ligament tear","una sobrecarga":"an overload","Una temporada en algo más de un mes. El mercado se renueva cada 3 horas y media.":"A season in just over a month. The market refreshes every 3 and a half hours.","Una temporada en unos 3 meses. El mercado se renueva cada 8 horas.":"A season in about 3 months. The market refreshes every 8 hours.","Una temporada en unos 4 meses y medio. El mercado se renueva cada 12 horas.":"A season in about 4 and a half months. The market refreshes every 12 hours.","una torcedura":"a twist","unas molestias":"some discomfort","unión":"union","Unirme":"Join","Unirse a una liga con código":"Join a league with a code","unos dolores":"some pain","V-E-D":"W-D-L","Va a por las mejores criaturas y puja fuerte, siempre lleva la Megapiedra, invierte pronto y vende caro.":"Goes for the best creatures and bids hard, always uses the Mega Stone, invests early and sells dear.","vacía":"empty","Vale para todas las jornadas.":"It applies to every matchday.","Valor":"Value","Valor actual":"Current value","Valor actual:":"Current value:","Valor del equipo":"Team value","Ve en la oscuridad":"See in the dark","Velocidad":"Speed","Velocidad de la simulación":"Simulation speed","Veloz Ball":"Fast Ball","Vende una criatura.":"Sell a creature.","Vender":"Sell","Vender una criatura":"Sell a creature","Veneno":"Poison","Ver":"View","Ver más":"See more","Ver menos":"See less","Ver mi propuesta de intercambio":"See my trade proposal","Ver nº de pujas":"See no. of bids","ver resultados":"see results","Ver su cláusula":"See its clause","Verdes de bosque y hierba alta, con letra pixelada clásica.":"Forest greens and tall grass, with classic pixel lettering.","Victoria":"Win","vie 21:00":"Fri 21:00","Violeta y naranja, entre lo antiguo y lo futuro.":"Violet and orange, between the ancient and the future.","Volador":"Flying","Volver":"Back","Votar a favor":"Vote in favour","Votar en contra":"Vote against","Voto registrado.":"Vote recorded.","Votos:":"Votes:","Vuela a cualquier ciudad de Galar":"Fly to any city in Galar","Vuelos baratos sobre las nubes":"Cheap flights above the clouds","Vuelta estimada:":"Estimated return:","Vuelve a empezar con los mismos managers y ajustes: criaturas, dinero, mercado y jornadas de cero, con un reparto nuevo.":"Starts over with the same managers and settings: creatures, money, market and matchdays from scratch, with a new handout.","Vuelve el mercado con criaturas libres nuevas al momento; después se renueva cada día como siempre.":"The market comes back with new free creatures right away; after that it refreshes every day as usual.","y está en venta":"and is for sale","y, con la app cerrada, en una comprobación cada 15 minutos":"and, with the app closed, in a check every 15 minutes","Ya está al máximo":"It's already at the maximum","Ya hay una cuenta con ese correo. Entra con ella.":"There's already an account with that email. Sign in with it.","Ya no combate en la liga":"It no longer battles in the league","Ya no se puede cambiar: la liga ha jugado alguna jornada.":"It can no longer be changed: the league has played a matchday.","ya no se puede fichar quedando en negativo":"you can no longer sign going into the red","Ya se ha vendido todo: vuelve en la próxima renovación.":"Everything's already sold: come back at the next refresh.","Ya tengo cuenta":"I already have an account","Ya tienes el máximo de":"You already have the maximum of","Ya tienes patrocinador esta temporada":"You already have a sponsor this season",": fichas, tragaperras, ruleta y blackjack":": chips, slots, roulette and blackjack","¡blackjack!":"blackjack!","¡Clausulazo!":"Release clause paid!","¿Renuevas con":"Renew with",". Las cambias en la caja y, cuando quieras, las vuelves a cambiar por pokéyenes para tu liga.":". Buy them at the cashier and, whenever you like, change them back into pokéyen for your league.","(no la cobras: rescindiste otro contrato esta temporada)":"(you don't get it: you terminated another contract this season)","1 renovación":"1 renewal","1.ª renovación":"1st renewal","A veces paga tarde.":"Sometimes pays late.","Acéptalo o intenta llegar a un acuerdo antes de la próxima jornada":"Accept it or try to reach a deal before the next matchday","Aceptar la rescisión":"Accept the termination","Aerolíneas Altaria":"Altaria Airlines","Ahora las primas las pagan los patrocinadores.":"Bonuses are now paid by the sponsors.","Ahora las primas son fijas para todos.":"Bonuses are now fixed for everyone.","Antes decide si renuevas con tu patrocinador o valoras otras opciones":"First decide whether you renew with your sponsor or look at other options","Antiguo patrocinador":"Former sponsor","Apuesta":"Bet","Apuesta al menos 1 ficha":"Bet at least 1 chip","Apuestas Murkrow":"Murkrow Bets","Banca":"Dealer","Baya":"Berry","Cada ficha vale":"Each chip is worth","Cada mánager firma con un patrocinador, que le paga todas las primas (por jornada, por punto, por titular en el equipo ideal y por el puesto en la jornada) y los premios de fin de temporada, cada uno con sus cantidades. Unos pagan más, otros pagan a tiempo… y alguno, ni eso.":"Each manager signs with a sponsor, who pays all their bonuses (per matchday, per point, per starter in the ideal team and for the matchday position) and the end-of-season prizes, each with its own amounts. Some pay more, others pay on time… and some, not even that.","Cada mánager podrá renovar con su patrocinador o valorar otras opciones.":"Each manager can renew with their sponsor or look at other options.","Cada mánager puede rescindir su contrato desde la hoja de su patrocinador y firmar otro al momento, pero sin cobrar su prima de firma; el patrocinador rescindido no le vuelve a ofrecer nada esa temporada.":"Each manager can terminate their contract from their sponsor sheet and sign another straight away, but without collecting its signing bonus; the terminated sponsor won't offer them anything again that season.","Cambia tus fichas por pokéyenes":"Change your chips into pokéyen","Cambiar todas":"Change them all","Casi seguro que acepta.":"Almost certain to accept.","Casi siempre paga a tiempo.":"Almost always pays on time.","Centro de recuperación":"Recovery centre","Clausulazo":"Release clause","Columna":"Column","Común":"Common","Criptomonedas Porygon-Z":"Porygon-Z Crypto","Cuando otro mánager paga la cláusula de una criatura tuya y se la lleva.":"When another manager pays the clause of one of your creatures and takes it.","Dejar el ritmo real no tiene vuelta atrás: después":"Leaving real pace can't be undone: afterwards","Dejó el ritmo real: sólo se puede cambiar entre las velocidades aceleradas.":"It left real pace: it can only switch between the accelerated speeds.","Después sólo se podrá cambiar entre las velocidades aceleradas.":"Afterwards it can only switch between the accelerated speeds.","Después, el fundador puede pasarla a acelerada o manual (sin vuelta atrás).":"Later, the founder can switch it to accelerated or manual (no going back).","Doblar":"Double","Docena":"Dozen","Donde se forjan los campeones":"Where champions are forged","Dudosa":"Doubtful","El Casino Rocket sólo abre sus puertas a quien patrocina":"Casino Rocket only opens its doors to those it sponsors","El Centro de recuperación sólo está en las ligas simuladas":"The Recovery centre is only in simulated leagues","El contrato termina y te llegan tres ofertas nuevas (con prima de firma).":"The contract ends and you get three new offers (with signing bonus).","Elige cuántas fichas quieres":"Choose how many chips you want","Elige cuántas fichas quieres cambiar":"Choose how many chips you want to change","En esta liga no se pueden rescindir los contratos":"Contracts can't be terminated in this league","En total has apostado":"In total you've bet","Entrar en el Casino Rocket":"Enter Casino Rocket","Épica":"Epic","Es probable que acepte.":"Likely to accept.","Ese patrocinador ya no existe":"That sponsor no longer exists","Esta liga dejó el ritmo real: sólo puede cambiar entre las velocidades aceleradas":"This league left real pace: it can only switch between the accelerated speeds","Esta liga juega con primas fijas, iguales para todos: no hay patrocinadores.":"This league plays with fixed bonuses, the same for everyone: there are no sponsors.","Esta liga juega con primas fijas: no hay patrocinadores":"This league plays with fixed bonuses: there are no sponsors","Esta liga pasó a manual y ya no puede cambiar de velocidad":"This league switched to manual and can no longer change speed","Fiable":"Reliable","Fichas":"Chips","Fichas que apuestas":"Chips you bet","Fichas, tragaperras, ruleta y blackjack":"Chips, slots, roulette and blackjack","Fisios y enfermeras para tus criaturas: se lesionan menos y, si se lesionan, vuelven antes.":"Physios and nurses for your creatures: they get injured less and, if they do, come back sooner.","gana la banca":"the dealer wins","Girando…":"Spinning…","Hacemos crecer tu oro":"We grow your gold","Haz al menos una apuesta":"Place at least one bet","Impago":"Unpaid","Impar":"Odd","Impecable":"Impeccable","Inversiones Gholdengo":"Gholdengo Investments","Juega con cabeza: la banca siempre tiene un poco de ventaja.":"Play wisely: the house always has a small edge.","Jugada desconocida":"Unknown play","La banca gana esta vez.":"The house wins this time.","La banca siempre te invita":"The house always treats you","La liga paga a todos las mismas primas y los mismos premios de temporada. No hay patrocinadores.":"The league pays everyone the same bonuses and the same season prizes. There are no sponsors.","la liga se quedará en manual para siempre":"the league will stay manual forever","La moneda del futuro (o no)":"The currency of the future (or not)","las primas pasan a pagarlas los patrocinadores":"bonuses are now paid by the sponsors","las primas pasan a ser fijas e iguales para todos (sin patrocinadores)":"bonuses become fixed and the same for everyone (no sponsors)","le perdona lo que le debía":"forgives what it owed","Legendaria":"Legendary","Llega a 21 sin pasarte y gana a la banca, que se planta con 17. El blackjack paga 3 a 2.":"Get to 21 without going bust and beat the dealer, who stands on 17. Blackjack pays 3 to 2.","los de cada patrocinador, según el puesto":"each sponsor's, depending on the position","Los patrocinadores tienen rareza (lo fácil que es que te hagan una oferta) y reputación (si pagan a tiempo, tarde o nunca). Al empezar cada temporada, quien tenía contrato puede renovarlo un poco mejorado o valorar otras opciones; si un mánager va muy mal, su patrocinador puede querer rescindir.":"Sponsors have rarity (how easily they make you an offer) and reputation (whether they pay on time, late or never). At the start of each season, whoever had a contract can renew it slightly improved or look at other options; if a manager is doing very badly, their sponsor may want to terminate.","Los retrasos suelen acabar pagándose solos; los impagos, sólo si reclamas. Puedes enviar una carta al día.":"Late payments usually end up being paid on their own; unpaid ones, only if you claim. You can send one letter a day.","Moneda amuleto":"Amulet Coin","Morosa":"Defaulter","Negro":"Black","Ningún patrocinador te debe dinero":"No sponsor owes you money","Ningún patrocinador te debe nada.":"No sponsor owes you anything.","No da dinero: protege a tus criaturas de las lesiones simuladas de esta liga.":"It doesn't earn money: it protects your creatures from this league's simulated injuries.","no pagaron":"they didn't pay","no te volverá a ofrecer nada esta temporada y perderás lo que te deba.":"won't offer you anything again this season and you'll lose what it owes you.","No tienes fichas suficientes":"You don't have enough chips","No tienes ningún contrato que renovar":"You have no contract to renew","No tienes ninguna mano en juego":"You have no hand in play","No tienes patrocinador":"You have no sponsor","No tienes tantas fichas":"You don't have that many chips","Número":"Number","Número de fichas":"Number of chips","Ocultos":"Hidden","Opción desconocida":"Unknown option","Paga tarde a menudo y a veces no paga nunca.":"Often pays late and sometimes never pays.","Pagos de patrocinio con retraso o sin pagar: puedes reclamarlos por carta":"Late or unpaid sponsorship payments: you can claim them by letter","Pagos pendientes":"Pending payments","Par":"Even","Pasó a manual: la velocidad ya no se puede cambiar.":"It switched to manual: the speed can no longer be changed.","Pedir carta":"Hit","Perdonarle lo que te debe":"Forgive what it owes you","Plantarse":"Stand","Poco común":"Uncommon","por cada punto de tu equipo":"for each point your team scores","por cada titular en el equipo ideal":"for each starter in the ideal team","premio de temporada":"season prize","Primas fijas":"Fixed bonuses","Puedes pasarla a acelerada o manual, pero no tiene vuelta atrás.":"You can switch it to accelerated or manual, but there's no going back.","Queda 1 trofeo oculto por descubrir.":"1 hidden trophy left to discover.","Quién paga las primas":"Who pays the bonuses","quiere rescindir tu contrato":"wants to terminate your contract","R del Team Rocket":"Team Rocket R","Rara":"Rare","Rebajar las primas un 25 %":"Cut bonuses by 25%","Rebajar las primas un 50 %":"Cut bonuses by 50%","Reclamar por carta formal":"Claim by formal letter","Regular":"Average","Renovar":"Renew","Renovar contrato":"Renew contract","Repartir (":"Deal (","Reputación":"Reputation","Rescindir":"Terminate","Rescindir contratos":"Terminate contracts","Rescindir el contrato":"Terminate the contract","Retraso":"Late","Rojo":"Red","Ruleta":"Roulette","Ruleta europea: del 0 al 36. Con el 0 pierden todas las apuestas salvo la de número.":"European roulette: from 0 to 36. On 0 every bet loses except a number bet.","Se puede cambiar en cualquier momento.":"It can be changed at any time.","se pueden rescindir los contratos de patrocinio":"sponsorship contracts can be terminated","si acabas la temporada 1.º / 2.º / 3.º":"if you finish the season 1st / 2nd / 3rd","si quedas 1.º / 2.º / 3.º en la jornada":"if you finish 1st / 2nd / 3rd on the matchday","Si rescindes, podrás firmar con otro patrocinador al momento, pero sin cobrar su prima de firma.":"If you terminate, you can sign with another sponsor straight away, but without collecting their signing bonus.","Si valoras otras opciones, te llegarán tres ofertas de otros patrocinadores y ésta se pierde.":"If you look at other options, you'll get three offers from other sponsors and this one is lost.","Siempre hay una corazonada":"There's always a hunch","Siempre paga a tiempo.":"Always pays on time.","Siete":"Seven","Sin premio. ¡Otra vez!":"No prize. Again!","Sólo el fundador de la liga puede dejar el ritmo real, y no tiene vuelta atrás":"Only the league founder can leave real pace, and there's no going back","Sólo el fundador puede pasarla a acelerada o manual.":"Only the founder can switch it to accelerated or manual.","sólo se podrá cambiar entre las velocidades aceleradas":"it can only switch between the accelerated speeds","Sólo se puede doblar con las dos primeras cartas":"You can only double on the first two cards","Sólo si te debe dinero. Bastante probable que acepte.":"Only if it owes you money. Fairly likely to accept.","Su antiguo patrocinador":"Their former sponsor","su patrocinador":"their sponsor","Suele pagar tarde y alguna vez no paga.":"Usually pays late and sometimes doesn't pay.","Tabla de premios":"Paytable","Tapete de casino":"Casino felt","Tapete verde, fichas doradas y luces de sala de juego.":"Green felt, golden chips and gaming-hall lights.","Te abre las puertas del":"Opens the doors of","Te deben":"You're owed","te pasas":"you're bust","Termina antes la mano de blackjack":"Finish the blackjack hand first","terminó con la temporada. Te ofrece renovar con unas condiciones un poco mejores (":"ended with the season. It offers to renew on slightly better terms (","Torre Batalla":"Battle Tower","Tragaperras":"Slots","Tres marcas quieren patrocinar a tu equipo esta temporada. Elige bien: el contrato dura toda la temporada, su logo saldrá en tu campo y ellos pagan tus primas. Ojo con la reputación: los que tienen poca suelen ofrecer más, pero no siempre cumplen.":"Three brands want to sponsor your team this season. Choose well: the contract lasts the whole season, their logo will appear on your pitch and they pay your bonuses. Watch the reputation: those with little of it tend to offer more, but don't always deliver.","Tú ·":"You ·","Tu contrato con":"Your contract with","Tu contrato con el Casino Rocket ha terminado: ya no puedes jugar, pero sí cambiar tus fichas por pokéyenes.":"Your contract with Casino Rocket has ended: you can no longer play, but you can change your chips into pokéyen.","Tu contrato terminó: renueva con mejores condiciones o valora otras opciones":"Your contract ended: renew on better terms or look at other options","Tu patrocinador":"Your sponsor","Tu patrocinador esta temporada":"Your sponsor this season","Tu patrocinador no ha pedido rescindir el contrato":"Your sponsor hasn't asked to terminate the contract","Tu patrocinador quiere rescindir":"Your sponsor wants to terminate","Tus resultados no le convencen. Puedes aceptarlo o intentar llegar a un acuerdo; si no respondes antes de que se puntúe la próxima jornada, lo rescindirá igualmente.":"Your results don't convince them. You can accept it or try to reach a deal; if you don't answer before the next matchday is scored, they'll terminate it anyway.","Última carta:":"Last letter:","un patrocinador":"a sponsor","Una liga manual ya no puede cambiar de velocidad.":"A manual league can no longer change speed.","Valorar otras opciones":"Look at other options","Vuela entre nubes de algodón":"Fly among cotton clouds","y ganado":"and won","Ya has enviado una carta hoy: vuelve a intentarlo mañana":"You've already sent a letter today: try again tomorrow","Ya has reclamado hoy":"You've already claimed today","ya no se pueden rescindir los contratos de patrocinio":"sponsorship contracts can no longer be terminated","Ya tienes una mano en juego":"You already have a hand in play","Idioma":"Language","Actuación":"Performance","Ajustes de los admins":"Admin adjustments","Aún no hay movimientos esta temporada.":"No transactions this season yet.","Cafetería del gimnasio":"Gym café","Cambio pendiente: guárdalo con «Guardar cambios» en el menú principal de Herramientas de Administración.":"Pending change: save it with “Save changes” in the Admin Tools main menu.","Cambios descartados.":"Changes discarded.","Cambios guardados: aparecen en las novedades de la liga.":"Changes saved: they appear in the league news.","Canteranos de la guardería":"Nursery youngsters","Cláusulas":"Release clauses","de saldo negativo permitido en esta liga.":"of negative balance allowed in this league.","Desarrollador":"Developer","Descartar":"Discard","Dinero inicial":"Starting money","Disponible":"Available","El Casino Rocket sólo abre sus puertas a quien patrocina.":"Casino Rocket only opens its doors to the teams it sponsors.","En pujas y ofertas":"In bids and offers","Esta temporada":"This season","Estás jugando con tus fichas de esta liga.":"You're playing with your chips from this league.","Finanzas":"Finances","Gastos":"Expenses","Gimnasio":"Gym","Guardando…":"Saving…","Guardar cambios":"Save changes","Impuestos":"Taxes","Incluye hasta":"Includes up to","Ingresos":"Income","Jugar con mis fichas":"Play with my chips","Los movimientos se apuntan desde la versión 0.43: aparecerán aquí a partir de ahora.":"Transactions are recorded from version 0.43 on: they'll show up here from now on.","Misiones":"Missions","Otros":"Other","Patrocinio":"Sponsorship","Práctica de desarrolladores (gratis)":"Developer practice (free)","Práctica de desarrolladores: fichas gratis y nada se guarda en la liga.":"Developer practice: free chips and nothing is saved to the league.","Practicar gratis":"Practise for free","Premios de temporada":"Season prizes","Recargar":"Refill","Si cierras sin guardar, no se aplicará nada.":"If you close without saving, nothing will be applied.","Sueldos":"Wages","Tienes 1 cambio sin guardar":"You have 1 unsaved change","Tus fichas del Casino Rocket":"Your Casino Rocket chips","Tus finanzas":"Your finances","Últimos movimientos":"Latest transactions","Ventas":"Sales","Cambia los textos de la app y los nombres de las criaturas. Al elegirlo, la app se vuelve a abrir.":"Changes the app's texts and the creatures' names. When you pick one, the app reopens.","Años":"Age","Carrera de la criatura":"Creature's career","Cierre del mercado de verano de los clubes":"Clubs' summer window closes","Código abierto":"Open source","Código, textos y traducciones":"Code, texts and translations","Datos de las especies":"Species data","el abdomen":"the abdomen","el arranque de una pata delantera":"the top of a front leg","el caparazón":"the shell","el cuerpo":"the body","el tórax":"the thorax","Entrará en tu plantilla con 16 años, una media y un potencial; tú serás su Entrenador Original. Combatirá con el club que elijas desde la próxima jornada y evolucionará al cabo de unas jornadas. Si juega mucho y no se lesiona, su media irá subiendo hacia su potencial temporada a temporada.":"It joins your squad aged 16, with a rating and a potential; you'll be its Original Trainer. It battles for the club you choose from the next matchday and evolves after a few matchdays. If it plays a lot and stays fit, its rating will rise towards its potential season after season.","Escritos con ayuda de inteligencia artificial (Claude, de Anthropic) a partir de las ideas y las pruebas del equipo.":"Written with the help of artificial intelligence (Claude, by Anthropic) from the team's ideas and testing.","Ese club no le ha hecho ninguna oferta":"That club hasn't made it an offer","Essentials BES y sus colaboradores, tal como figuran en sus créditos. Sprites e iconos de estilo Game Boy Color del remake de Johto de la comunidad BES.":"Essentials BES and its contributors, as listed in their credits. Game Boy Color-style sprites and icons from the BES community's Johto remake.","Fichar aquí":"Sign here","Fuentes":"Fonts","Gracias a todos los que comparten sus recursos con los fans.":"Thanks to everyone who shares their resources with fans.","Gráficos de la app":"App graphics","Iconos, banderas, gimnasio, logos de patrocinadores, Poké Balls de fondo y demás dibujos están hechos con código para la app.":"Icons, flags, gym, sponsor logos, background Poké Balls and the other drawings are made with code for the app.","Idea y dirección":"Idea and direction","la aleta de la cola":"the tail fin","la aleta del lomo":"the dorsal fin","La app está hecha con ayuda de la IA y nos parece justo que su código sea de todos: puedes verlo, aprender de él y mejorarlo.":"The app is made with the help of AI, and we think it's fair for its code to belong to everyone: you can read it, learn from it and improve it.","la base":"the base","la base del cuerpo":"the base of its body","la cola":"the tail","la espalda":"the back","la parte alta del cuerpo":"the upper body","la parte de abajo del cuerpo":"the lower body","la parte de atrás":"the back","Las criaturas originales y todos los nombres, personajes, imágenes y marcas relacionados son propiedad de sus titulares: Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. y The Pokémon Company. Este paquete es un proyecto no oficial hecho por fans: no está afiliado, patrocinado, respaldado ni aprobado por ninguna de esas empresas, y no pretende infringir sus derechos. Es gratuito, sin ánimo de lucro y para uso privado. Si eres titular de algún derecho y quieres que se retire cualquier contenido, escríbenos y lo quitaremos de inmediato.":"The original creatures and all related names, characters, images and trademarks belong to their owners: Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. and The Pokémon Company. This pack is an unofficial fan project: it is not affiliated with, sponsored, endorsed or approved by any of those companies, and it does not intend to infringe their rights. It is free, non-profit and for private use. If you own any rights and want any content removed, write to us and we will remove it immediately.","Las criaturas originales y todos los nombres, personajes, imágenes y marcas relacionados son propiedad de sus titulares: Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. y The Pokémon Company. Pokefantasy es un proyecto no oficial hecho por fans: no está afiliado, patrocinado, respaldado ni aprobado por ninguna de esas empresas, y no pretende infringir sus derechos. Es gratuito, sin ánimo de lucro y para uso privado. Si eres titular de algún derecho y quieres que se retire cualquier contenido, escríbenos y lo quitaremos de inmediato.":"The original creatures and all related names, characters, images and trademarks belong to their owners: Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. and The Pokémon Company. Pokefantasy is an unofficial fan project: it is not affiliated with, sponsored, endorsed or approved by any of those companies, and it does not intend to infringe their rights. It is free, non-profit and for private use. If you own any rights and want any content removed, write to us and we will remove it immediately.","Los canteranos sólo pueden subir al primer equipo en las ligas simuladas":"Youngsters can only be promoted to the first team in simulated leagues","los músculos de la cola":"the tail muscles","los músculos de una pata trasera":"the muscles of a hind leg","Los nombres de equipos y patrocinadores son inventados o parodias.":"Team and sponsor names are made up or parodies.","Mercado de invierno de los clubes":"Clubs' winter window","Mercado de invierno de los clubes abierto hasta el 2 de febrero":"Clubs' winter window open until 2 February","Mercado de verano de los clubes":"Clubs' summer window","Mercado de verano de los clubes abierto hasta el 1 de septiembre":"Clubs' summer window open until 1 September","Minutos repartidos con otros":"Minutes shared with others","Muchos minutos desde el principio":"Plenty of minutes from the start","Pidiendo ofertas a los clubes…":"Asking the clubs for offers…","Pocos minutos al principio: club con estrellas":"Few minutes at first: club full of stars","PokeAPI (nombres en cada idioma, formas del cuerpo y evoluciones).":"PokeAPI (names in each language, body shapes and evolutions).","Potencial":"Potential","Programas":"Software","React y Vite (licencia MIT). Firebase (Google) para las ligas online.":"React and Vite (MIT licence). Firebase (Google) for online leagues.","Retirada: ya no combate":"Retired: no longer battles","Retirada: ya no combate. Mejor venderla.":"Retired: no longer battles. Better sell it.","Sin descargo de responsabilidad: si sus criaturas son de alguna franquicia, conviene que lo lleve.":"No disclaimer: if its creatures come from a franchise, it should include one.","Sprites e iconos de las criaturas":"Creature sprites and icons","Su club dejó la liga: ya no combate":"Its club left the league: no longer battles","Su club ya no está en la liga: no combate. Mejor venderla.":"Its club is no longer in the league: it doesn't battle. Better sell it.","Subir al primer equipo":"Promote to first team","Temporada para retirarse":"Season left","Temporadas para retirarse":"Seasons left","Tocado por fiebre. Puede que combata.":"Under the weather with a fever. It may battle.","Tocado tras un combate muy duro. Puede que combata.":"Knocked after a very tough battle. It may battle.","un ala":"a wing","un brazo":"an arm","un costado":"a flank","un hombro":"a shoulder","un lado del cuerpo":"one side of its body","un pie":"a foot","un tentáculo":"a tentacle","una aleta":"a fin","una de sus cabezas":"one of its heads","una de sus patas":"one of its legs","una de sus patitas":"one of its little legs","una garra":"a talon","una pata delantera":"a front leg","una pierna":"a leg","uno de sus cuerpos":"one of its bodies","el tendón de una pierna":"the tendon of a leg","los músculos de una pierna":"the muscles of a leg","el muslo de una pierna":"the thigh of a leg","la pantorrilla de una pierna":"the calf of a leg","la rodilla de una pierna":"a knee","el tobillo de una pierna":"an ankle","el hueso de una pierna":"a leg bone","los músculos de una pata":"the muscles of a leg","Ver el código de la app":"View the app's code","En esta liga simulada también puedes subirlos al primer equipo.":"In this simulated league you can also promote them to the first team.","23 de octubre de 2026":"23 October 2026","Al crear la cuenta aceptas la política de privacidad: sólo guardamos lo necesario para jugar, sin anuncios ni seguimiento, y puedes borrarlo todo cuando quieras.":"By creating an account you accept the privacy policy: we only keep what's needed to play, with no ads or tracking, and you can delete it all whenever you like.","Borra de este móvil todas tus ligas de la demo, tu apodo y tu imagen.":"Deletes all your demo leagues, your nickname and your picture from this phone.","Borra tu cuenta, tu perfil, tus trofeos y tu sitio en todas tus ligas. Si fundaste una liga con más mánagers, pasa a otro admin; si sólo quedabas tú, se borra entera. No se puede deshacer.":"Deletes your account, your profile, your trophies and your place in all your leagues. If you founded a league with other managers, it passes to another admin; if you were the only one left, it's deleted entirely. This can't be undone.","Borrando…":"Deleting…","Borrar mi cuenta":"Delete my account","Borrar mi cuenta para siempre":"Delete my account forever","Calendario de la liga":"League calendar","Contacto":"Contact","Cuánto tiempo":"How long","Cuenta borrada.":"Account deleted.","Dónde están":"Where they are","El correo de contacto aún no está puesto: pregunta a quien te invitó a la liga.":"The contact email hasn't been set yet: ask whoever invited you to the league.","El equipo de Pokefantasy, un proyecto de fans gratuito y sin ánimo de lucro. Para cualquier cosa sobre tus datos, escríbenos al correo de contacto que sale al final.":"The Pokefantasy team, a free, non-profit fan project. For anything about your data, write to the contact email at the end.","En los servidores de Google Firebase. Google puede tratarlos fuera de la Unión Europea con las garantías del RGPD (cláusulas contractuales tipo).":"On Google Firebase's servers. Google may process them outside the European Union with GDPR safeguards (standard contractual clauses).","En tu móvil":"On your phone","Escribe BORRAR para confirmar":"Type BORRAR to confirm","La app guarda en tu móvil tus preferencias (idioma, tema, avisos), una copia de los datos del juego para ir más rápido y, en la app de Android, lo necesario para avisarte con la app cerrada. Para la temporada real consulta servicios públicos de terceros sin enviarles ningún dato tuyo.":"The app stores on your phone your preferences (language, theme, notifications), a copy of the game data to run faster and, in the Android app, what it needs to notify you while closed. For the real season it queries public third-party services without sending them any of your data.","Leer la política de privacidad":"Read the privacy policy","Los admins pasan los días desde aquí.":"Admins move the days on from here.","Los mánagers de tus ligas ven tu apodo, tu imagen, tu equipo y lo que pasa en la liga. Nadie más. No hay anuncios, no hay analítica ni seguimiento y no vendemos ni cedemos tus datos a nadie.":"The managers in your leagues see your nickname, your picture, your team and what happens in the league. Nobody else. There are no ads, no analytics or tracking, and we don't sell or share your data with anyone.","Mánager borrado":"Deleted manager","Menores":"Minors","Mientras tengas la cuenta. Puedes borrarla cuando quieras en Ajustes → Cuenta → Borrar mi cuenta: se borran tu perfil y tu sitio en tus ligas. Las novedades antiguas de una liga pueden seguir nombrando tu apodo.":"As long as you have the account. You can delete it whenever you like in Settings → Account → Delete my account: your profile and your place in your leagues are deleted. Old league news may still mention your nickname.","Para qué":"What for","Política de privacidad":"Privacy policy","Privacidad":"Privacy","Puedes pedirnos ver, corregir, llevarte o borrar tus datos y oponerte a su uso. Si crees que no los tratamos bien, puedes reclamar ante la Agencia Española de Protección de Datos (aepd.es).":"You can ask us to see, correct, take away or delete your data and object to its use. If you think we're not handling it properly, you can complain to the Spanish Data Protection Agency (aepd.es).","Qué datos guardamos":"What data we keep","Quién los ve":"Who sees them","Quién se encarga de tus datos":"Who looks after your data","Quiero borrar mi cuenta":"I want to delete my account","Si juegas online: tu correo y tu contraseña (los guarda Firebase Authentication, de Google; nosotros nunca vemos la contraseña), tu apodo, tu imagen de mánager, tus trofeos, títulos, temas y estadísticas, y lo que haces en tus ligas (tu equipo, tu dinero, tus pujas y ofertas, tus movimientos y las novedades de la liga). En la demo todo se guarda sólo en tu móvil.":"If you play online: your email and password (kept by Google's Firebase Authentication; we never see the password), your nickname, your manager picture, your trophies, titles, themes and stats, and what you do in your leagues (your team, money, bids and offers, transactions and league news). In the demo everything is kept only on your phone.","Si tienes menos de 14 años, necesitas el permiso de tu madre, padre o tutor para crear una cuenta.":"If you're under 14, you need permission from your parent or guardian to create an account.","Sólo para que puedas jugar tus ligas con tus amigos. La base legal es darte el servicio que nos pides al crear la cuenta (artículo 6.1.b del RGPD).":"Only so you can play your leagues with your friends. The legal basis is providing the service you ask for when you create the account (Article 6(1)(b) GDPR).","Tus derechos":"Your rights","MUR":"WAL","SOP":"SUP","ATQ":"ATK","Muro especial":"Special wall","Muro físico":"Physical wall","lunes":"Monday","martes":"Tuesday","jueves":"Thursday","viernes":"Friday","domingo":"Sunday","criaturas":"creatures","criatura":"creature","abre":"opens","Pokémon y todos los nombres, personajes, imágenes y marcas relacionados son propiedad de Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. y The Pokémon Company. Pokefantasy es un proyecto no oficial hecho por fans: no está afiliado, patrocinado, respaldado ni aprobado por ninguna de esas empresas, y no pretende infringir sus derechos. Es gratuito, sin ánimo de lucro y para uso privado. Las imágenes de este paquete proceden de los juegos de Pokémon y de recursos de la comunidad de fans; ninguna está generada por IA. Si eres titular de algún derecho y quieres que se retire cualquier contenido, escríbenos y lo quitaremos de inmediato.":"Pokémon and all related names, characters, images and trademarks are the property of Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. and The Pokémon Company. Pokefantasy is an unofficial fan-made project: it is not affiliated with, sponsored, endorsed or approved by any of those companies, and does not intend to infringe their rights. It is free, non-profit and for private use. The images in this pack come from the Pokémon games and from fan-community resources; none is AI-generated. If you hold any rights and want any content removed, write to us and we will take it down immediately.","Fuentes pixeladas":"Pixel fonts","«Power Clear» (2007) y «Power Red and Green» (2008), de Peter O. (upokecenter.com), distribuidas con Pokémon Essentials.":"\"Power Clear\" (2007) and \"Power Red and Green\" (2008), by Peter O. (upokecenter.com), distributed with Pokémon Essentials.","PokeAPI (pokeapi.co): nombres en cada idioma, formas del cuerpo y evoluciones.":"PokeAPI (pokeapi.co): names in each language, body shapes and evolutions.","Paquete":"Pack","Criaturas de esta liga":"This league's creatures","Esferas y megapiedras":"Poké Balls and Mega Stones","Iconos de objetos de los juegos de Pokémon (© The Pokémon Company), del repositorio de sprites de PokeAPI (github.com/PokeAPI/sprites): las Poké Ball y la megapiedra de cada criatura.":"Item icons from the Pokémon games (© The Pokémon Company), from PokeAPI's sprite repository (github.com/PokeAPI/sprites): the Poké Balls and each creature's Mega Stone.","Sonidos":"Sounds","Efectos de sonido de los juegos de Pokémon (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. y GAME FREAK inc.), tal como los distribuye Pokémon Essentials, de la carpeta de audio del fangame Pokémon Predatorlocke.":"Sound effects from the Pokémon games (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc.), as distributed with Pokémon Essentials, from the audio folder of the fan game Pokémon Predatorlocke.","Amuleto Iris y fósiles":"Shiny Charm and fossils","Amuleto Iris":"Shiny Charm","Museo de Ciudad Plateada":"Pewter Museum of Science","Fósil Helix":"Helix Fossil","Fósil Domo":"Dome Fossil","Ámbar Viejo":"Old Amber","Ornitofósil y Dracofósil":"Fossilized Bird and Fossilized Drake","Ornitofósil y Plesiofósil":"Fossilized Bird and Fossilized Dino","Ictiofósil y Dracofósil":"Fossilized Fish and Fossilized Drake","Ictiofósil y Plesiofósil":"Fossilized Fish and Fossilized Dino","Caverna Abisal Cero":"Area Zero Underdepths","Roca oscura y cristales teracristalinos que brillan en lo más hondo de la Zona Cero.":"Dark rock and Terastal crystals glowing in the depths of Area Zero.","Criaturas anacrónicas fichadas":"Paradox Pokémon signed","Los Monkai pueden cambiar de aspecto a voluntad. Por eso, cuando una liga se viste con un paquete de franquicia, lo que ves son Monkai que han tomado la forma de otras criaturas.":"Monkai can change their appearance at will. In this league they have turned into Pokémon: every Pokémon you see is, deep down, a Monkai.","Sprites e iconos de los juegos de Pokémon (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. y GAME FREAK inc.), en el formato de Pokémon Essentials, con los huevos recoloreados. Versiones en estilo Game Boy Color: sprites de Pokémon Oro, Plata y Cristal, y adaptaciones de la comunidad de Pokémon Essentials para las especies posteriores.":"Pokémon sprites and icons from the Pokémon games (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc.), in the Pokémon Essentials format, with recoloured eggs. Game Boy Color style versions: sprites from Pokémon Gold, Silver and Crystal, and adaptations by the Pokémon Essentials community for later species.","Sprites de las clases de entrenador de los juegos de Pokémon de Game Boy Advance y de Game Boy Color (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. y GAME FREAK inc.), en el formato de Pokémon Essentials.":"Trainer class sprites from the Game Boy Advance and Game Boy Color Pokémon games (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc.), in the Pokémon Essentials format.","Iconos de objetos de los juegos de Pokémon (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. y GAME FREAK inc.), tal como los distribuye Pokémon Essentials.":"Item icons from the Pokémon games (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc.), as distributed with Pokémon Essentials.","Efectos de sonido y fanfarria de captura de Pokémon Rojo Fuego y Verde Hoja (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. y GAME FREAK inc.; música de Junichi Masuda y Go Ichinose), tal como los distribuye Pokémon Essentials.":"Sound effects and capture fanfare from Pokémon FireRed and LeafGreen (© Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc.; music by Junichi Masuda and Go Ichinose), as distributed with Pokémon Essentials.","Kit para crear juegos de Pokémon con RPG Maker, de donde salen el formato y muchos de los recursos de este paquete: creado por Flameguru, desarrollado por Poccil (Peter O.) y mantenido por Maruno, con todos sus colaboradores (lista completa en sus créditos).":"Kit for making Pokémon games with RPG Maker, the source of the format and many of the resources in this pack: created by Flameguru, developed by Poccil (Peter O.) and maintained by Maruno, with all their contributors (full list in its credits).","Pokémon Essentials":"Pokémon Essentials","Pokémon fósil":"Fossil Pokémon","Pokémon fósiles":"Fossil Pokémon","Pokémon legendario":"Legendary Pokémon","Pokémon legendarios":"Legendary Pokémon","Pokémon singular":"Mythical Pokémon","Pokémon singulares":"Mythical Pokémon","Portadora de la Megapiedra":"Mega Stone holder","Portadore de la Megapiedra":"Mega Stone holder","Socia del Team Rocket":"Team Rocket Partner","Socie del Team Rocket":"Team Rocket Partner","Campeón de Entrenadores":"Trainers' Champion","Campeona de Entrenadores":"Trainers' Champion","Campeone de Entrenadores":"Trainers' Champion","Guarda del Safari":"Safari Warden","Imagen del Entrenador":"Trainer picture","Imagen de la Entrenadora":"Trainer picture","Imagen de le Entrenadore":"Trainer picture"},"patrones":[["{0} se va con {1} en {2}.","{0} is leaving for {1} in {2}."],["{0} ya es tuya en {1}.","{0} is now yours in {1}."],["{0}: aún puedes cumplir {1} misiones antes de que se renueven.","{0}: you can still complete {1} missions before they refresh."],["{0}: el mercado se ha renovado con {1} criaturas libres nuevas.","{0}: the market has refreshed with {1} new free creatures."],["{0}: el Team Rocket vende criaturas hasta que empiece la jornada.","{0}: Team Rocket is selling creatures until the matchday starts."],["{0}: en una hora se cierran los equipos. ¡Revisa t